window.CIT_QUIZ=[{"ch":"00","q":"In the Oath of Citizenship, what do you promise to faithfully observe?","zq":"在公民誓詞中，你承諾忠實遵守什麼？","o":["The laws of Canada, including the Constitution","The customs of your province","The rules of your workplace","The traditions of your family"],"zo":["加拿大的法律，包括憲法","你所在省的習俗","你工作場所的規定","你家庭的傳統"],"a":0,"e":"\"I will faithfully observe the laws of Canada including the Constitution.\"","ze":"「我將忠實遵守加拿大的法律，包括憲法。」","p":3,"id":"q0001","slug":"00-intro-oath"},{"ch":"00","q":"According to \"Understanding the Oath,\" Canada is personified by whom?","zq":"根據「理解誓詞」，加拿大由誰來體現？","o":["The Prime Minister","The Sovereign","The Governor General","The Chief Justice"],"zo":["總理","君主","總督","首席大法官"],"a":1,"e":"Canada is personified by the Sovereign just as the Sovereign is personified by Canada.","ze":"君主是加拿大的化身，正如加拿大也是君主的化身。","p":0,"id":"q0002","slug":"00-intro-oath"},{"ch":"00","q":"For how many years, according to the guide, have settlers and immigrants contributed to Canada's diversity?","zq":"根據指南，拓荒者和移民為加拿大的多元做出貢獻已有多少年？","o":["100 years","200 years","400 years","1,000 years"],"zo":["100 年","200 年","400 年","1,000 年"],"a":2,"e":"\"For 400 years, settlers and immigrants have contributed to the diversity and richness of our country.\"","ze":"「四百年來，拓荒者和移民為我們國家的多元與豐富做出貢獻。」","p":6,"id":"q0003","slug":"00-intro-oath"},{"ch":"00","q":"What binds Canadians together, according to the Message to Our Readers?","zq":"根據「給讀者的話」，什麼把加拿大人凝聚在一起？","o":["A common language","A shared commitment to the rule of law and to the institutions of parliamentary government","A single religion","Military service"],"zo":["共同的語言","共同信守法治和議會政府制度","單一宗教","兵役"],"a":1,"e":"Canadians are bound together by a shared commitment to the rule of law and parliamentary institutions.","ze":"加拿大人因共同信守法治和議會制度而凝聚。","p":7,"id":"q0004","slug":"00-intro-oath"},{"ch":"00","q":"Besides English or French, what must you learn about to become a citizen?","zq":"除了英語或法語，你還必須了解什麼才能成為公民？","o":["Only Canadian sports","Voting procedures, Canada's history, symbols, democratic institutions, geography, and the rights and responsibilities of citizenship","The French civil code in detail","The names of all prime ministers"],"zo":["只有加拿大的運動","投票程序、歷史、象徵、民主制度、地理，以及公民的權利與責任","詳細的法國民法典","所有總理的名字"],"a":1,"e":"These are the subject areas of the citizenship test.","ze":"這些就是公民考試的主題範圍。","p":9,"id":"q0005","slug":"00-intro-oath"},{"ch":"00","q":"Citizens must obey Canada's laws and respect what?","zq":"公民必須遵守加拿大的法律並尊重什麼？","o":["The rights and freedoms of others","The Prime Minister's decisions","Only their own culture","Provincial borders"],"zo":["他人的權利與自由","總理的決定","只有自己的文化","省界"],"a":0,"e":"\"They must obey Canada's laws and respect the rights and freedoms of others.\"","ze":"「他們必須遵守加拿大的法律，並尊重他人的權利與自由。」","p":11,"id":"q0006","slug":"00-intro-oath"},{"ch":"00","q":"True or false: In Canada, loyalty is professed to a document such as the Constitution.","zq":"是非題：在加拿大，效忠的對象是憲法這類文件。","o":["True","False"],"zo":["對","錯"],"a":1,"e":"Loyalty is professed to the Sovereign, a person who represents all Canadians, not to a document, a flag or a country.","ze":"效忠的是代表全體加拿大人的君主，不是文件、旗幟或國家。","p":0,"id":"q0007","slug":"00-intro-oath"},{"ch":"00","q":"The Oath refers to the Sovereign's \"Heirs and Successors.\" What does this mean?","zq":"誓詞提到君主的「繼承人與後繼者」，這是什麼意思？","o":["The Sovereign's advisors","Those who will inherit the throne after the current Sovereign","Members of Parliament","Future prime ministers"],"zo":["君主的顧問","將在現任君主之後繼承王位的人","國會議員","未來的總理"],"a":1,"e":"The oath is to the Sovereign and to those who succeed to the Crown.","ze":"誓詞效忠君主以及之後繼承王位的人。","p":3,"id":"q0008","slug":"00-intro-oath"},{"ch":"00","q":"What does the guide say about coming to Canada and taking the step toward citizenship?","zq":"指南對來到加拿大並朝公民身分跨出這一步怎麼說？","o":["You are ending your old story","You are helping to write the continuing story of Canada","You must forget your heritage","You become a permanent resident"],"zo":["你結束了舊的故事","你在幫忙書寫加拿大持續不斷的故事","你必須忘記自己的傳承","你成為永久居民"],"a":1,"e":"\"You are helping to write the continuing story of Canada.\"","ze":"「你就是在幫忙書寫加拿大持續不斷的故事。」","p":8,"id":"q0009","slug":"00-intro-oath"},{"ch":"00","q":"In which language(s) is the Oath of Citizenship printed in the guide?","zq":"指南中公民誓詞以哪些語言印出？","o":["English only","English and French","English, French and Inuktitut","French only"],"zo":["只有英文","英文和法文","英文、法文和因紐特語","只有法文"],"a":1,"e":"The Oath appears in English and in French (Le serment de citoyenneté).","ze":"誓詞以英文和法文印出（Le serment de citoyenneté）。","p":3,"id":"q0010","slug":"00-intro-oath"},{"ch":"00","q":"Which of these is described in the Message as something Canadians have made sacrifices to defend?","zq":"「給讀者的話」說加拿大人曾為了捍衛什麼而做出犧牲？","o":["Their way of life","Their tax rates","Their sports teams","Their weather"],"zo":["他們的生活方式","他們的稅率","他們的運動隊伍","他們的天氣"],"a":0,"e":"\"Canadians take pride in their identity and have made sacrifices to defend their way of life.\"","ze":"「加拿大人以自己的身分為榮，並曾為捍衛自己的生活方式做出犧牲。」","p":8,"id":"q0011","slug":"00-intro-oath"},{"ch":"00","q":"What kind of society does the guide say newcomers have helped Canada build?","zq":"指南說新移民幫助加拿大建立了什麼樣的社會？","o":["A free, law-abiding and prosperous society","A closed and traditional society","A military society","A society without laws"],"zo":["自由、守法、繁榮的社會","封閉而傳統的社會","軍事化社會","沒有法律的社會"],"a":0,"e":"\"...to help us build a free, law-abiding and prosperous society.\"","ze":"「……幫助我們建立一個自由、守法、繁榮的社會。」","p":6,"id":"q0012","slug":"00-intro-oath"},{"ch":"00","q":"Which of the following is NOT one of the three descriptions of Canada in the Message to Our Readers?","zq":"下列哪一項不是「給讀者的話」對加拿大的三個描述之一？","o":["A constitutional monarchy","A parliamentary democracy","A federal state","A presidential republic"],"zo":["君主立憲國","議會民主國","聯邦國家","總統制共和國"],"a":3,"e":"Canada is not a republic; it is a constitutional monarchy.","ze":"加拿大不是共和國，而是君主立憲國。","p":7,"id":"q0013","slug":"00-intro-oath"},{"ch":"00","q":"The current oath names the Sovereign as the King of Canada. Who is the King?","zq":"現行誓詞中的君主是加拿大國王。國王是誰？","o":["King George VI","King Edward VIII","King Charles III","King William V"],"zo":["喬治六世","愛德華八世","查理三世","威廉五世"],"a":2,"e":"Charles III became King in September 2022 after the death of Queen Elizabeth II.","ze":"查理三世於 2022 年 9 月伊莉莎白二世女王過世後即位。","p":4,"id":"q0014","slug":"00-intro-oath"},{"ch":"00","q":"What does the Message to Our Readers wish you at the end?","zq":"「給讀者的話」最後祝你什麼？","o":["Good luck","Safe travels","Happy birthday","Merry Christmas"],"zo":["祝你好運","一路平安","生日快樂","聖誕快樂"],"a":0,"e":"\"This guide will help you prepare to become a Canadian citizen. Good luck!\"","ze":"「這本指南會幫助你準備成為加拿大公民。祝你好運！」","p":11,"id":"q0015","slug":"00-intro-oath"},{"ch":"01","q":"When you apply for citizenship, what will officials check first?","zq":"申請公民身分時，官員會先查核什麼？","o":["Your bank account","Your status, that you are not prohibited from applying, and that you meet the requirements","Your English grammar","Your driving record"],"zo":["你的銀行帳戶","你的身分狀態、是否被禁止申請、是否符合要求","你的英文文法","你的駕駛紀錄"],"a":1,"e":"Officials check status, prohibitions and requirements.","ze":"官員查核身分狀態、禁止事項和申請要求。","p":0,"id":"q0016","slug":"01-applying-citizenship"},{"ch":"01","q":"How long may your citizenship application take?","zq":"你的公民申請可能需要多久？","o":["A few days","Several months","Exactly one year","Ten years"],"zo":["幾天","好幾個月","正好一年","十年"],"a":1,"e":"Keep your correct address on file with the Call Centre during processing.","ze":"處理期間要確保客服中心有你正確的地址。","p":0,"id":"q0017","slug":"01-applying-citizenship"},{"ch":"01","q":"Which of the following does the guide recommend to prepare for the test?","zq":"指南建議用什麼方式準備考試？","o":["Hire a private tutor only","Ask a friend or family member to help you practise answering questions about Canada","Memorize the phone book","Watch television"],"zo":["只請家教","請朋友或家人幫你練習回答關於加拿大的問題","背電話簿","看電視"],"a":1,"e":"Also: study the guide, ask about citizenship classes, and take free English or French classes.","ze":"還有：研讀指南、詢問公民課程、上政府免費的英法語課。","p":1,"id":"q0018","slug":"01-applying-citizenship"},{"ch":"01","q":"Who offers free English or French language classes, according to the guide?","zq":"根據指南，誰提供免費的英語或法語課程？","o":["The United Nations","The Government of Canada","Private companies","The Royal Family"],"zo":["聯合國","加拿大政府","私人公司","王室"],"a":1,"e":"The Government of Canada offers language classes free of charge.","ze":"加拿大政府免費提供語言課程。","p":1,"id":"q0019","slug":"01-applying-citizenship"},{"ch":"01","q":"What two basic requirements does the citizenship test assess?","zq":"公民考試評估哪兩項基本要求？","o":["Wealth and employment","Knowledge of Canada and of the rights and responsibilities of citizenship, and adequate knowledge of English or French","Driving and swimming","Height and age"],"zo":["財富與就業","對加拿大與公民權責的了解，以及足夠的英語或法語能力","駕駛與游泳","身高與年齡"],"a":1,"e":"These are the two basic requirements tested.","ze":"這是考試測驗的兩項基本要求。","p":2,"id":"q0020","slug":"01-applying-citizenship"},{"ch":"01","q":"Where does the guide say the Citizenship Regulations' information on the knowledge requirement can be found?","zq":"指南說《公民法規》關於知識要求的資訊在哪裡可以找到？","o":["In the study guide","At the post office","In a newspaper","At the embassy"],"zo":["在學習指南裡","在郵局","在報紙上","在大使館"],"a":0,"e":"All required information is provided in the study guide.","ze":"所有需要的資訊都在學習指南裡。","p":2,"id":"q0021","slug":"01-applying-citizenship"},{"ch":"01","q":"What does the Notice to Appear tell you?","zq":"「出席通知」告訴你什麼？","o":["Your test score","The date, time and place of your citizenship ceremony","Your new address","Your tax refund"],"zo":["你的考試成績","公民宣誓儀式的日期、時間和地點","你的新地址","你的退稅"],"a":1,"e":"You receive it after passing the test and meeting all other requirements.","ze":"通過考試並符合其他要求後你會收到它。","p":3,"id":"q0022","slug":"01-applying-citizenship"},{"ch":"01","q":"What do you sign at the citizenship ceremony?","zq":"在公民宣誓儀式上你簽署什麼？","o":["A lease","The oath form","A passport application","A voter registration card"],"zo":["租約","誓詞表格","護照申請表","選民登記卡"],"a":1,"e":"You take the Oath, sign the oath form and receive your Citizenship Certificate.","ze":"你宣讀誓詞、簽署誓詞表格並領取公民證書。","p":4,"id":"q0023","slug":"01-applying-citizenship"},{"ch":"01","q":"If you do not pass the test, what happens?","zq":"如果你沒通過考試，會怎麼樣？","o":["You are deported","You receive a notification indicating the next steps","You lose permanent residence","Nothing"],"zo":["你被驅逐出境","你會收到說明下一步的通知","你失去永久居留權","什麼都不會發生"],"a":1,"e":"You will receive a notification indicating the next steps.","ze":"你會收到一份通知，說明接下來的步驟。","p":4,"id":"q0024","slug":"01-applying-citizenship"},{"ch":"01","q":"Whom are you encouraged to bring to the citizenship ceremony?","zq":"指南鼓勵你帶誰來參加公民宣誓儀式？","o":["Your lawyer","Your family and friends","Your employer","No one"],"zo":["你的律師","你的家人和朋友","你的雇主","不帶人"],"a":1,"e":"\"You are encouraged to bring your family and friends to celebrate this occasion.\"","ze":"「我們鼓勵你帶家人和朋友一起來慶祝這個時刻。」","p":4,"id":"q0025","slug":"01-applying-citizenship"},{"ch":"01","q":"What document do you receive at the end of the ceremony?","zq":"儀式結束時你會領到什麼文件？","o":["A permanent resident card","A Canadian Citizenship Certificate","A social insurance card","A birth certificate"],"zo":["永久居民卡","加拿大公民證書","社會保險卡","出生證明"],"a":1,"e":"You receive your Canadian Citizenship Certificate.","ze":"你會領取加拿大公民證書。","p":4,"id":"q0026","slug":"01-applying-citizenship"},{"ch":"01","q":"Whom can you contact for information on citizenship classes?","zq":"你可以聯絡誰詢問公民課程的資訊？","o":["A local school or school board, a college, a community centre or an organization serving immigrants","Only the Prime Minister's office","The Supreme Court","A bank"],"zo":["當地學校或教育局、學院、社區中心或為移民服務的組織","只有總理辦公室","最高法院","銀行"],"a":0,"e":"The guide lists these local sources.","ze":"指南列出這些地方資源。","p":1,"id":"q0027","slug":"01-applying-citizenship"},{"ch":"01","q":"True or false: The citizenship test can never be an interview.","zq":"是非題：公民考試絕對不會是面試。","o":["True","False"],"zo":["對","錯"],"a":1,"e":"It is usually a written test, but it could be an interview.","ze":"通常是筆試，但也可能是面試。","p":2,"id":"q0028","slug":"01-applying-citizenship"},{"ch":"01","q":"According to the guide, on what are all the test questions based?","zq":"根據指南，所有考試題目根據什麼出題？","o":["Current news","The subject areas noted in the Citizenship Regulations","Provincial laws only","Random trivia"],"zo":["時事新聞","《公民法規》列出的主題範圍","只有省法律","隨機冷知識"],"a":1,"e":"All required information is in the study guide.","ze":"所有需要的資訊都在學習指南裡。","p":2,"id":"q0029","slug":"01-applying-citizenship"},{"ch":"01","q":"What should you make sure the Call Centre always has while your application is being processed?","zq":"申請處理期間，你應該確保客服中心一直有你的什麼？","o":["Your correct address","Your favourite colour","Your car model","Your school grades"],"zo":["正確的地址","你最喜歡的顏色","你的車型","你的學校成績"],"a":0,"e":"Keep your address up to date so notices reach you.","ze":"保持地址最新，通知才寄得到。","p":0,"id":"q0030","slug":"01-applying-citizenship"},{"ch":"01","q":"Which step comes first: taking the Oath or writing the citizenship test?","zq":"哪一步先：宣讀誓詞還是參加公民考試？","o":["Taking the Oath","Writing the test","They happen at the same time","Neither is required"],"zo":["宣讀誓詞","參加考試","同時進行","都不需要"],"a":1,"e":"You write the test first; after passing you receive a Notice to Appear to take the Oath.","ze":"先考試；通過後收到出席通知去宣誓。","p":3,"id":"q0031","slug":"01-applying-citizenship"},{"ch":"00","q":"In Canada, to whom or what do citizens profess their loyalty in the Oath of Citizenship?","zq":"在加拿大，公民在誓詞中效忠的對象是誰或什麼？","o":["The Constitution","The flag","The Sovereign (King or Queen) who represents all Canadians","The Prime Minister"],"zo":["憲法","國旗","代表全體加拿大人的君主（國王或女王）","總理"],"a":2,"e":"Canadians profess loyalty to a person, the Sovereign, not to a document, a flag or a country.","ze":"加拿大人效忠的是「人」——君主，而不是文件、旗幟或國家。","p":0,"id":"q0032","slug":"00-intro-oath"},{"ch":"00","q":"According to the guide, immigrants in which age range must have adequate knowledge of English or French to become citizens?","zq":"根據指南，哪個年齡範圍的移民必須具備足夠的英語或法語能力才能入籍？","o":["14 to 64","18 to 54","18 to 65","21 to 60"],"zo":["14 到 64 歲","18 到 54 歲","18 到 65 歲","21 到 60 歲"],"a":1,"e":"Applicants aged 18 to 54 need adequate English or French; those 55 and over are exempt.","ze":"18 到 54 歲需要足夠的英語或法語能力；55 歲以上免除。","p":7,"id":"q0033","slug":"00-intro-oath"},{"ch":"00","q":"Which three words describe Canada's system of government in the Message to Our Readers?","zq":"「給讀者的話」用哪三個詞描述加拿大的政府制度？","o":["A republic, a federation and a democracy","A constitutional monarchy, a parliamentary democracy and a federal state","A monarchy, a dictatorship and a union","A commonwealth, a confederacy and a state"],"zo":["共和國、聯盟、民主國","君主立憲國、議會民主國、聯邦國家","君主國、獨裁國、聯合體","國協、邦聯、國家"],"a":1,"e":"Canada is a constitutional monarchy, a parliamentary democracy and a federal state.","ze":"加拿大是君主立憲國、議會民主國，也是聯邦國家。","p":5,"id":"q0034","slug":"00-intro-oath"},{"ch":"00","q":"The Oath of Citizenship says the Constitution recognizes and affirms the Aboriginal and treaty rights of which peoples?","zq":"公民誓詞說憲法承認並確認哪些民族的原住民權利與條約權利？","o":["First Nations, Inuit and Métis","Acadians, Quebecers and Loyalists","English, French and Scottish","Cree, Dene and Sioux only"],"zo":["第一民族、因紐特人與梅蒂人","阿卡迪亞人、魁北克人與效忠派","英格蘭人、法國人與蘇格蘭人","只有克里族、迪尼族與蘇族"],"a":0,"e":"The oath names First Nations, Inuit and Métis peoples.","ze":"誓詞點名第一民族、因紐特人與梅蒂人。","p":3,"id":"q0035","slug":"00-intro-oath"},{"ch":"00","q":"True or false: Since September 2022 the Sovereign of Canada is King Charles III.","zq":"是非題：2022 年 9 月起，加拿大的君主是國王查理三世。","o":["True","False"],"zo":["對","錯"],"a":0,"e":"Queen Elizabeth II died in September 2022; the oath now names the King.","ze":"伊莉莎白二世女王於 2022 年 9 月過世；現在誓詞念的是國王。","p":4,"id":"q0036","slug":"00-intro-oath"},{"ch":"01","q":"Adult applicants of what age do not need to write the citizenship test?","zq":"幾歲以上的成年申請人不需要參加公民考試？","o":["50 and over","55 and over","60 and over","65 and over"],"zo":["50 歲以上","55 歲以上","60 歲以上","65 歲以上"],"a":1,"e":"Adult applicants 55 years of age and over do not need to write the test.","ze":"55 歲以上的成年申請人不需要參加考試。","p":2,"id":"q0037","slug":"01-applying-citizenship"},{"ch":"01","q":"The citizenship test is usually a written test, but it could also be what?","zq":"公民考試通常是筆試，但也可能是什麼？","o":["An essay","An interview","A group discussion","A home visit"],"zo":["作文","面試","小組討論","家訪"],"a":1,"e":"The test is usually written but could be an interview.","ze":"考試通常是筆試，但也可能是面試。","p":2,"id":"q0038","slug":"01-applying-citizenship"},{"ch":"01","q":"What will you receive if you pass the test and meet all other requirements?","zq":"如果你通過考試並符合其他所有要求，你會收到什麼？","o":["A passport","A Notice to Appear to Take the Oath of Citizenship","A voter information card","A permanent resident card"],"zo":["護照","宣誓入籍出席通知","選民資訊卡","永久居民卡"],"a":1,"e":"The Notice to Appear tells you the date, time and place of your citizenship ceremony.","ze":"這份通知會告訴你公民宣誓儀式的日期、時間和地點。","p":3,"id":"q0039","slug":"01-applying-citizenship"},{"ch":"01","q":"Which of the following happens at the citizenship ceremony?","zq":"下列哪一項會在公民宣誓儀式上發生？","o":["You write the citizenship test","You take the Oath, sign the oath form and receive your Citizenship Certificate","You apply for a passport","You register to vote"],"zo":["參加公民考試","宣讀誓詞、簽署誓詞表格並領取公民證書","申請護照","登記投票"],"a":1,"e":"At the ceremony you take the Oath of Citizenship, sign the oath form and receive your Canadian Citizenship Certificate.","ze":"在儀式上你會宣讀誓詞、簽署誓詞表格，並領取加拿大公民證書。","p":4,"id":"q0040","slug":"01-applying-citizenship"},{"ch":"01","q":"True or false: All citizenship test questions are based on the subject areas in the Citizenship Regulations, and all the information is in the study guide.","zq":"是非題：所有公民考試題目都根據《公民法規》的主題範圍出題，而且所有資訊都在學習指南裡。","o":["True","False"],"zo":["對","錯"],"a":0,"e":"The guide states this directly.","ze":"指南直接這樣說明。","p":2,"id":"q0041","slug":"01-applying-citizenship"},{"ch":"02","q":"Canada's 800-year-old tradition of ordered liberty dates back to the signing of which document?","zq":"加拿大八百年的「有序自由」傳統可追溯到哪份文件的簽署？","o":["The British North America Act","The Quebec Act","Magna Carta in 1215","The Constitution Act, 1982"],"zo":["《英屬北美法案》","《魁北克法案》","1215 年的《大憲章》","《1982 年憲法法案》"],"a":2,"e":"Magna Carta, the Great Charter of Freedoms, was signed in England in 1215.","ze":"《大憲章》（自由大憲章）於 1215 年在英國簽署。","p":2,"id":"q0042","slug":"02-rights-responsibilities"},{"ch":"02","q":"Which of the following is NOT one of the fundamental freedoms listed in the guide?","zq":"下列哪一項不是指南列出的基本自由？","o":["Freedom of conscience and religion","Freedom of peaceful assembly","Freedom of association","Freedom from taxation"],"zo":["良心與宗教自由","和平集會自由","結社自由","免稅自由"],"a":3,"e":"The four are freedom of conscience and religion; thought, belief, opinion and expression; peaceful assembly; and association.","ze":"四項是：良心與宗教；思想、信仰、意見與表達；和平集會；結社。","p":2,"id":"q0043","slug":"02-rights-responsibilities"},{"ch":"02","q":"Habeas corpus is the right to do what?","zq":"人身保護令（habeas corpus）是什麼權利？","o":["To own property","To challenge unlawful detention by the state","To vote in elections","To a free lawyer"],"zo":["擁有財產","挑戰國家的非法拘留","在選舉中投票","免費律師"],"a":1,"e":"Habeas corpus comes from English common law and lets you challenge unlawful detention.","ze":"人身保護令來自英國普通法，讓你可以挑戰非法拘留。","p":3,"id":"q0044","slug":"02-rights-responsibilities"},{"ch":"02","q":"In what year was the Canadian Charter of Rights and Freedoms entrenched in the Constitution?","zq":"《加拿大權利與自由憲章》在哪一年寫入憲法？","o":["1867","1931","1982","1999"],"zo":["1867","1931","1982","1999"],"a":2,"e":"The Constitution was amended in 1982 to entrench the Charter.","ze":"憲法在 1982 年修訂，把憲章寫進憲法。","p":4,"id":"q0045","slug":"02-rights-responsibilities"},{"ch":"02","q":"Which right allows Canadians to live and work anywhere in Canada, enter and leave freely, and apply for a passport?","zq":"哪一項權利讓加拿大人可以在加拿大任何地方居住工作、自由出入境並申請護照？","o":["Mobility Rights","Aboriginal Peoples' Rights","Official Language Rights","Multiculturalism"],"zo":["遷徙權","原住民權利","官方語言權利","多元文化"],"a":0,"e":"These are the Mobility Rights in the Charter.","ze":"這是憲章裡的遷徙權。","p":5,"id":"q0046","slug":"02-rights-responsibilities"},{"ch":"02","q":"True or false: There is compulsory military service in Canada.","zq":"是非題：加拿大有義務兵役制。","o":["True","False"],"zo":["對","錯"],"a":1,"e":"There is no compulsory military service; serving is a voluntary, noble way to contribute.","ze":"加拿大沒有義務兵役；服役是自願、崇高的貢獻方式。","p":6,"id":"q0047","slug":"02-rights-responsibilities"},{"ch":"02","q":"Which of the following is a responsibility of citizenship?","zq":"下列哪一項是公民的責任？","o":["Owning a home","Serving on a jury when called","Speaking both official languages","Joining a political party"],"zo":["擁有房子","被傳喚時擔任陪審員","會說兩種官方語言","加入政黨"],"a":1,"e":"When called to serve on a jury, you are legally required to do so.","ze":"被傳喚擔任陪審員時，依法必須去。","p":11,"id":"q0048","slug":"02-rights-responsibilities"},{"ch":"02","q":"What does the guide say about spousal abuse, honour killings, female genital mutilation and forced marriage?","zq":"指南對配偶虐待、榮譽殺人、女性割禮和強迫婚姻怎麼說？","o":["They are tolerated as cultural practices","They are barbaric cultural practices punished severely under criminal law","They are civil matters only","They are decided by each province"],"zo":["作為文化習俗被容忍","是野蠻的文化習俗，依刑法嚴厲懲罰","只是民事問題","由各省自行決定"],"a":1,"e":"Canada's openness does not extend to these practices; those guilty are severely punished under criminal law.","ze":"加拿大的開放不包括這些行為；犯下這些罪行的人依刑法嚴懲。","p":8,"id":"q0049","slug":"02-rights-responsibilities"},{"ch":"02","q":"How many responsibilities of citizenship does the guide list?","zq":"指南列出幾項公民責任？","o":["Three","Four","Six","Ten"],"zo":["三項","四項","六項","十項"],"a":2,"e":"Obeying the law; taking responsibility for oneself and one's family; serving on a jury; voting in elections; helping others in the community; protecting and enjoying our heritage and environment.","ze":"遵守法律、為自己和家人負責、擔任陪審員、投票、幫助社區他人、保護遺產與環境。","p":9,"id":"q0050","slug":"02-rights-responsibilities"},{"ch":"02","q":"The Charter begins with words recognizing the supremacy of God and what else?","zq":"憲章開頭的文字承認上帝至高無上，以及什麼？","o":["The rule of law","The power of Parliament","The authority of the Prime Minister","The rights of provinces"],"zo":["法治","國會的權力","總理的權威","各省的權利"],"a":0,"e":"\"Whereas Canada is founded upon principles that recognize the supremacy of God and the rule of law.\"","ze":"「鑒於加拿大建立在承認上帝至高無上與法治的原則之上。」","p":4,"id":"q0051","slug":"02-rights-responsibilities"},{"ch":"02","q":"Where can young people learn discipline, responsibility and skills, according to the Defending Canada section?","zq":"根據「保衛加拿大」一節，年輕人可以在哪裡學習紀律、責任感和技能？","o":["The cadets","The Senate","A political party","A trade union"],"zo":["青年軍校（cadets）","參議院","政黨","工會"],"a":0,"e":"Getting involved in the cadets teaches discipline, responsibility and skills.","ze":"參加青年軍校可以學習紀律、責任感和技能。","p":6,"id":"q0052","slug":"02-rights-responsibilities"},{"ch":"03","q":"Who are the three founding peoples of Canada?","zq":"加拿大的三個奠基民族是誰？","o":["Aboriginal, French and British","Inuit, Métis and First Nations","English, Irish and Scottish","French, American and British"],"zo":["原住民、法裔和英裔","因紐特人、梅蒂人和第一民族","英格蘭人、愛爾蘭人和蘇格蘭人","法國人、美國人和英國人"],"a":0,"e":"The three founding peoples are Aboriginal, French and British.","ze":"三個奠基民族是原住民、法裔和英裔。","p":1,"id":"q0053","slug":"03-who-we-are"},{"ch":"03","q":"Which key phrase from the British North America Act of 1867 do Canada's institutions uphold?","zq":"加拿大的制度堅守 1867 年《英屬北美法案》中的哪個關鍵詞句？","o":["Life, Liberty and the Pursuit of Happiness","Peace, Order and Good Government","Liberty, Equality, Fraternity","Unity in Diversity"],"zo":["生命、自由與追求幸福","和平、秩序與良好政府","自由、平等、博愛","多元中的團結"],"a":1,"e":"\"Peace, Order and Good Government\" is the key phrase from the 1867 Act.","ze":"「和平、秩序與良好政府」是 1867 年法案的關鍵詞句。","p":0,"id":"q0054","slug":"03-who-we-are"},{"ch":"03","q":"Territorial rights of Aboriginal peoples were first guaranteed through which document?","zq":"原住民的領土權利最早由哪份文件保障？","o":["The Quebec Act of 1774","The Royal Proclamation of 1763","The Constitutional Act of 1791","The Indian Act"],"zo":["1774 年《魁北克法案》","1763 年《皇家公告》","1791 年《憲法法案》","《印第安法》"],"a":1,"e":"King George III's Royal Proclamation of 1763 first guaranteed territorial rights and set the basis for treaties.","ze":"喬治三世 1763 年的《皇家公告》最早保障領土權利，並奠定條約談判基礎。","p":3,"id":"q0055","slug":"03-who-we-are"},{"ch":"03","q":"In what year did Ottawa formally apologize to former students of residential schools?","zq":"渥太華在哪一年正式向寄宿學校的前學生道歉？","o":["1988","1999","2006","2008"],"zo":["1988","1999","2006","2008"],"a":3,"e":"In 2008, Ottawa formally apologized to the former students.","ze":"2008 年渥太華正式道歉。","p":4,"id":"q0056","slug":"03-who-we-are"},{"ch":"03","q":"The term \"First Nations\" began to be used in which decade?","zq":"「第一民族」這個詞從哪個年代開始使用？","o":["1950s","1960s","1970s","1990s"],"zo":["1950 年代","1960 年代","1970 年代","1990 年代"],"a":2,"e":"In the 1970s the term First Nations began to be used.","ze":"1970 年代開始使用「第一民族」一詞。","p":6,"id":"q0057","slug":"03-who-we-are"},{"ch":"03","q":"What does \"Inuit\" mean in the Inuktitut language?","zq":"「Inuit」在因紐特語中是什麼意思？","o":["The land","The people","The hunters","The north"],"zo":["土地","人","獵人","北方"],"a":1,"e":"Inuit means \"the people.\"","ze":"Inuit 的意思是「人」。","p":7,"id":"q0058","slug":"03-who-we-are"},{"ch":"03","q":"The Métis speak their own dialect called what?","zq":"梅蒂人說的自己的方言叫什麼？","o":["Michif","Inuktitut","Cree","Acadian"],"zo":["米奇夫語","因紐特語","克里語","阿卡迪亞語"],"a":0,"e":"The Métis, of mixed Aboriginal and European ancestry, speak Michif.","ze":"原住民與歐洲人混血的梅蒂人說米奇夫語。","p":8,"id":"q0059","slug":"03-who-we-are"},{"ch":"03","q":"Approximately what percentage of Aboriginal people are First Nations?","zq":"原住民中大約百分之多少是第一民族？","o":["30%","4%","50%","65%"],"zo":["30%","4%","50%","65%"],"a":3,"e":"About 65% are First Nations, 30% Métis and 4% Inuit.","ze":"約 65% 是第一民族，30% 梅蒂人，4% 因紐特人。","p":8,"id":"q0060","slug":"03-who-we-are"},{"ch":"03","q":"Which is the only officially bilingual province?","zq":"哪一個省是唯一官方雙語的省份？","o":["Quebec","Ontario","New Brunswick","Manitoba"],"zo":["魁北克","安大略","新布藍瑞克","曼尼托巴"],"a":2,"e":"New Brunswick is the only officially bilingual province.","ze":"新布藍瑞克是唯一官方雙語的省份。","p":11,"id":"q0061","slug":"03-who-we-are"},{"ch":"03","q":"The Acadians are descendants of French colonists who began settling in what are now the Maritime provinces in which year?","zq":"阿卡迪亞人是法國殖民者的後裔，他們從哪一年開始在今天的濱海省份定居？","o":["1497","1604","1759","1867"],"zo":["1497","1604","1759","1867"],"a":1,"e":"Acadian settlement began in 1604; between 1755 and 1763 most were deported in the Great Upheaval.","ze":"阿卡迪亞人 1604 年開始定居；1755–1763 年多數在「大動盪」中被驅逐。","p":12,"id":"q0062","slug":"03-who-we-are"},{"ch":"03","q":"The deportation of more than two-thirds of the Acadians between 1755 and 1763 is known as what?","zq":"1755 到 1763 年間超過三分之二阿卡迪亞人被驅逐，這件事叫什麼？","o":["The Quiet Revolution","The Great Upheaval","The Conquest","The Rebellion"],"zo":["寧靜革命","大動盪","征服","叛亂"],"a":1,"e":"This ordeal is known as the \"Great Upheaval.\"","ze":"這場磨難被稱為「大動盪」。","p":12,"id":"q0063","slug":"03-who-we-are"},{"ch":"03","q":"In what year did the House of Commons recognize that the Quebecois form a nation within a united Canada?","zq":"眾議院在哪一年承認魁北克人在統一的加拿大之內構成一個民族？","o":["1980","1995","2006","2015"],"zo":["1980","1995","2006","2015"],"a":2,"e":"The House of Commons recognized this in 2006.","ze":"眾議院在 2006 年承認。","p":13,"id":"q0064","slug":"03-who-we-are"},{"ch":"03","q":"Since the 1970s, most immigrants to Canada have come from where?","zq":"自 1970 年代以來，大多數移民來自哪裡？","o":["Europe","Asian countries","South America","Africa"],"zo":["歐洲","亞洲國家","南美洲","非洲"],"a":1,"e":"Since the 1970s most immigrants have come from Asian countries.","ze":"1970 年代以來大多數移民來自亞洲國家。","p":17,"id":"q0065","slug":"03-who-we-are"},{"ch":"03","q":"What is the largest religious affiliation in Canada?","zq":"加拿大最大的宗教派別是什麼？","o":["Protestant","Catholic","Muslim","Sikh"],"zo":["新教","天主教","伊斯蘭教","錫克教"],"a":1,"e":"The largest religious affiliation is Catholic, followed by various Protestant churches.","ze":"最大的宗教派別是天主教，其次是各新教教會。","p":19,"id":"q0066","slug":"03-who-we-are"},{"ch":"03","q":"In Vancouver, what percentage of the population speak Chinese languages at home?","zq":"在溫哥華，百分之多少的人口在家說中文？","o":["3%","7%","13%","25%"],"zo":["3%","7%","13%","25%"],"a":2,"e":"13% in Vancouver; 7% in Toronto.","ze":"溫哥華 13%，多倫多 7%。","p":18,"id":"q0067","slug":"03-who-we-are"},{"ch":"03","q":"True or false: Gay and lesbian Canadians enjoy the full protection of and equal treatment under the law, including access to civil marriage.","zq":"是非題：同性戀加拿大人受法律完整保護與平等對待，包括可以締結民事婚姻。","o":["True","False"],"zo":["對","錯"],"a":0,"e":"The guide states this in the Diversity in Canada section.","ze":"指南在「加拿大的多元」一節這樣說明。","p":21,"id":"q0068","slug":"03-who-we-are"},{"ch":"03","q":"Who said immigrant groups \"should retain their individuality and each make its contribution to the national character\"?","zq":"誰說移民族群「應該保留各自的特性，並各自為國家的品格做出貢獻」？","o":["Sir John A. Macdonald","John Buchan, Lord Tweedsmuir, Governor General","Pierre Trudeau","Sir Wilfrid Laurier"],"zo":["約翰・A・麥克唐納爵士","總督約翰・布肯（特威茲繆爾男爵）","皮埃爾・杜魯道","威爾弗里德・勞里埃爵士"],"a":1,"e":"John Buchan, the 1st Baron Tweedsmuir, Governor General 1935–40.","ze":"約翰・布肯，第一代特威茲繆爾男爵，1935–40 年任總督。","p":9,"id":"q0069","slug":"03-who-we-are"},{"ch":"02","q":"Which of the following is a source of Canadian law?","zq":"下列哪一項是加拿大法律的來源？","o":["The civil code of France","The laws of the United States","The Roman Empire","The United Nations Charter"],"zo":["法國的民法典","美國的法律","羅馬帝國","聯合國憲章"],"a":0,"e":"Sources include laws passed by Parliament and provincial legislatures, English common law, the civil code of France and the unwritten constitution inherited from Great Britain.","ze":"來源包括國會與省議會通過的法律、英國普通法、法國民法典，以及從英國繼承的不成文憲法。","p":1,"id":"q0070","slug":"02-rights-responsibilities"},{"ch":"02","q":"Freedom of speech and of the press are part of which fundamental freedom?","zq":"言論自由和新聞自由屬於哪一項基本自由？","o":["Freedom of peaceful assembly","Freedom of thought, belief, opinion and expression","Freedom of association","Freedom of conscience and religion"],"zo":["和平集會自由","思想、信仰、意見與表達的自由","結社自由","良心與宗教自由"],"a":1,"e":"Freedom of expression includes freedom of speech and of the press.","ze":"表達自由包括言論自由和新聞自由。","p":2,"id":"q0071","slug":"02-rights-responsibilities"},{"ch":"02","q":"What does the Charter say about Aboriginal peoples' rights?","zq":"憲章對原住民權利怎麼說？","o":["They are cancelled","The rights guaranteed in the Charter will not adversely affect any treaty or other rights of Aboriginal peoples","They apply only in the North","They must be renegotiated"],"zo":["被取消","憲章保障的權利不會損害原住民的條約權利或其他權利","只適用於北方","必須重新談判"],"a":1,"e":"This is one of the Charter's additional rights listed in the guide.","ze":"這是指南列出的憲章附加權利之一。","p":5,"id":"q0072","slug":"02-rights-responsibilities"},{"ch":"02","q":"French and English have equal status where, according to the Official Language Rights?","zq":"根據官方語言權利，法語和英語在哪裡地位平等？","o":["Only in Quebec","In Parliament and throughout the government","Only in schools","Only in courts"],"zo":["只有在魁北克","在國會和整個政府","只有在學校","只有在法院"],"a":1,"e":"Official Language Rights and Minority Language Educational Rights.","ze":"官方語言權利與少數語言教育權利。","p":5,"id":"q0073","slug":"02-rights-responsibilities"},{"ch":"02","q":"How does the guide describe multiculturalism?","zq":"指南如何描述多元文化？","o":["A temporary policy","A fundamental characteristic of the Canadian heritage and identity","A provincial matter","A foreign idea"],"zo":["暫時的政策","加拿大傳統與身分的基本特徵","省的事務","外來的觀念"],"a":1,"e":"Canadians celebrate the gift of one another's presence and work hard to respect pluralism.","ze":"加拿大人珍視彼此的存在，努力尊重多元。","p":5,"id":"q0074","slug":"02-rights-responsibilities"},{"ch":"02","q":"Serving in the regular Canadian Forces includes which three branches?","zq":"在加拿大正規軍服役包括哪三個軍種？","o":["Navy, army and air force","Police, fire and ambulance","Coast Guard, cadets and militia","Marines, rangers and reserves"],"zo":["海軍、陸軍和空軍","警察、消防和救護","海岸防衛隊、青年軍校和民兵","陸戰隊、巡邏隊和後備"],"a":0,"e":"Serving in the Canadian Forces is described as a noble way to contribute to Canada.","ze":"在加拿大軍隊服役被描述為為加拿大貢獻的崇高方式。","p":6,"id":"q0075","slug":"02-rights-responsibilities"},{"ch":"02","q":"Besides the military, where else can you serve to help protect your community?","zq":"除了軍隊，你還可以在哪裡服務來保護社區？","o":["The Coast Guard, a police force or a fire department","The Senate","A bank","The United Nations"],"zo":["海岸防衛隊、警察局或消防隊","參議院","銀行","聯合國"],"a":0,"e":"By helping protect your community you follow in the footsteps of Canadians who made sacrifices.","ze":"保護社區就是追隨曾為國犧牲的加拿大人的腳步。","p":7,"id":"q0076","slug":"02-rights-responsibilities"},{"ch":"02","q":"Why does the guide say work is important?","zq":"指南為什麼說工作很重要？","o":["It is required by law","It contributes to personal dignity and self-respect, and to Canada's prosperity","It is the only way to vote","It replaces taxes"],"zo":["法律規定","它有助於個人尊嚴與自尊，也有助於加拿大的繁榮","是投票的唯一方式","可以取代納稅"],"a":1,"e":"Taking responsibility for oneself and one's family is a Canadian value.","ze":"為自己和家人負責是加拿大的價值觀。","p":10,"id":"q0077","slug":"02-rights-responsibilities"},{"ch":"02","q":"What does the guide say about the right to vote?","zq":"指南對投票權怎麼說？","o":["It is optional and unimportant","It comes with a responsibility to vote in federal, provincial or territorial and local elections","It applies only to federal elections","It must be earned through work"],"zo":["可有可無","伴隨著在聯邦、省或地區以及地方選舉中投票的責任","只適用於聯邦選舉","必須靠工作換取"],"a":1,"e":"Voting in elections is listed as a responsibility.","ze":"在選舉中投票被列為責任之一。","p":12,"id":"q0078","slug":"02-rights-responsibilities"},{"ch":"02","q":"Volunteering is described as an excellent way to do what?","zq":"當志工被描述為做什麼的絕佳方式？","o":["Earn money","Gain useful skills and develop friends and contacts","Avoid taxes","Get a passport"],"zo":["賺錢","獲得實用技能、結交朋友和建立人脈","避稅","取得護照"],"a":1,"e":"Millions of volunteers help others without pay.","ze":"數百萬志工無償幫助他人。","p":13,"id":"q0079","slug":"02-rights-responsibilities"},{"ch":"02","q":"Every citizen has a role in avoiding waste and pollution while protecting what?","zq":"每位公民都有責任避免浪費和污染，同時保護什麼？","o":["Canada's natural, cultural and architectural heritage for future generations","Only national parks","Private property","Government buildings"],"zo":["為後代保護加拿大的自然、文化與建築遺產","只有國家公園","私人財產","政府建築"],"a":0,"e":"Protecting and enjoying our heritage and environment is a responsibility.","ze":"保護並享受我們的遺產與環境是一項責任。","p":14,"id":"q0080","slug":"02-rights-responsibilities"},{"ch":"02","q":"What does \"No person or group is above the law\" illustrate?","zq":"「沒有任何人或團體可以凌駕於法律之上」說明什麼？","o":["The rule of law","Freedom of association","Mobility rights","Multiculturalism"],"zo":["法治","結社自由","遷徙權","多元文化"],"a":0,"e":"Individuals and governments are regulated by laws and not by arbitrary actions.","ze":"個人和政府都受法律規範，而非任意行為。","p":9,"id":"q0081","slug":"02-rights-responsibilities"},{"ch":"03","q":"Where are the ancestors of Aboriginal peoples believed to have migrated from?","zq":"一般認為原住民的祖先從哪裡遷徙而來？","o":["Europe","Asia","Africa","South America"],"zo":["歐洲","亞洲","非洲","南美洲"],"a":1,"e":"They were well established here long before European explorers arrived.","ze":"早在歐洲探險家到來之前他們就已定居於此。","p":2,"id":"q0082","slug":"03-who-we-are"},{"ch":"03","q":"About how many communities do First Nations people who live on reserve land occupy?","zq":"住在保留區的第一民族人口分布在大約多少個社區？","o":["60","600","6,000","60,000"],"zo":["60","600","6,000","60,000"],"a":1,"e":"About half of First Nations people live on reserve land in about 600 communities.","ze":"約一半第一民族人口住在約 600 個保留區社區。","p":6,"id":"q0083","slug":"03-who-we-are"},{"ch":"03","q":"How many Anglophones and Francophones are there in Canada, according to the guide?","zq":"根據指南，加拿大有多少英語人口和法語人口？","o":["18 million Anglophones and seven million Francophones","7 million Anglophones and 18 million Francophones","30 million Anglophones and one million Francophones","Equal numbers"],"zo":["一千八百萬英語人口和七百萬法語人口","七百萬英語人口和一千八百萬法語人口","三千萬英語人口和一百萬法語人口","一樣多"],"a":0,"e":"One million Francophones live outside Quebec, in Ontario, New Brunswick and Manitoba.","ze":"一百萬法語人口住在魁北克以外的安大略、新布藍瑞克和曼尼托巴。","p":11,"id":"q0084","slug":"03-who-we-are"},{"ch":"03","q":"How many French settlers of the 1600s and 1700s are most Quebecers descended from?","zq":"大多數魁北克人是 1600 與 1700 年代多少名法國移民的後裔？","o":["850","8,500","85,000","850,000"],"zo":["850","8,500","85,000","850,000"],"a":1,"e":"Most Quebecers are descendants of 8,500 French settlers.","ze":"大多數魁北克人是 8,500 名法國移民的後裔。","p":13,"id":"q0085","slug":"03-who-we-are"},{"ch":"03","q":"Why are Anglophones generally referred to as English Canadians?","zq":"為什麼說英語的人通常被稱為「英裔加拿大人」？","o":["Because they were born in England","Because English, Welsh, Scottish and Irish settlers established the basic way of life in English-speaking areas","Because of a law","Because of the flag"],"zo":["因為他們生在英格蘭","因為英格蘭、威爾斯、蘇格蘭和愛爾蘭的拓荒者奠定了英語地區的基本生活方式","因為一條法律","因為國旗"],"a":1,"e":"Generations of pioneers of British origins laid the foundations of the country.","ze":"一代代英國裔開拓者奠定了國家的基礎。","p":14,"id":"q0086","slug":"03-who-we-are"},{"ch":"03","q":"What does the guide say newcomers are expected to embrace in becoming Canadian?","zq":"指南說新移民在成為加拿大人時被期待擁抱什麼？","o":["Violent prejudices from their homeland","Democratic principles such as the rule of law","A single religion","Only English culture"],"zo":["來自家鄉的暴力偏見","法治等民主原則","單一宗教","只有英語文化"],"a":1,"e":"Past conflict does not justify bringing violent, extreme or hateful prejudices to Canada.","ze":"過去的衝突不能成為把暴力、極端或仇恨偏見帶進加拿大的理由。","p":15,"id":"q0087","slug":"03-who-we-are"},{"ch":"04","q":"Why did the first European explorers call the native peoples \"Indians\"?","zq":"最早的歐洲探險家為什麼把原住民叫作「印第安人」？","o":["Because they came from India","Because the explorers thought they had reached the East Indies","Because of their language","Because of a treaty"],"zo":["因為他們來自印度","因為探險家以為自己到了東印度群島","因為他們的語言","因為一份條約"],"a":1,"e":"The first explorers thought they had reached the East Indies.","ze":"最早的探險家以為自己抵達了東印度群島。","p":0,"id":"q0088","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"Which Aboriginal group was nomadic, following the bison herd?","zq":"哪一個原住民族群過游牧生活、跟隨野牛群？","o":["The Inuit","The Huron-Wendat","The Sioux","The Cree"],"zo":["因紐特人","休倫－溫達特族","蘇族","克里族"],"a":2,"e":"The Sioux were nomadic, following the bison (buffalo) herd.","ze":"蘇族過著游牧生活，跟隨野牛群遷徙。","p":0,"id":"q0089","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"Who were the first Europeans to reach Labrador and Newfoundland about 1,000 years ago?","zq":"大約一千年前，最早抵達拉布拉多和紐芬蘭的歐洲人是誰？","o":["The French","The Vikings from Iceland","The English","The Spanish"],"zo":["法國人","來自冰島的維京人","英國人","西班牙人"],"a":1,"e":"The Vikings' settlement, L'Anse aux Meadows, is a World Heritage site.","ze":"維京人的聚落遺址蘭塞奧茲牧草地是世界遺產。","p":2,"id":"q0090","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"Who was the first to draw a map of Canada's East Coast, in 1497?","zq":"1497 年第一個繪製加拿大東岸地圖的人是誰？","o":["Jacques Cartier","Samuel de Champlain","John Cabot","Henry Hudson"],"zo":["雅克・卡蒂亞","薩繆爾・德・尚普蘭","約翰・卡伯特","亨利・哈德遜"],"a":2,"e":"John Cabot's 1497 expedition began European exploration in earnest.","ze":"約翰・卡伯特 1497 年的遠征正式開啟歐洲人的探索。","p":3,"id":"q0091","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"The name \"Canada\" comes from the Iroquoian word \"kanata,\" which means what?","zq":"「Canada」來自易洛魁語「kanata」，意思是什麼？","o":["River","Village","Land of ice","Great lake"],"zo":["河流","村莊","冰之地","大湖"],"a":1,"e":"Cartier heard two captured guides use the word kanata, meaning \"village.\"","ze":"卡蒂亞聽到兩名被俘的嚮導說 kanata，意思是「村莊」。","p":4,"id":"q0092","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"Who built a fortress in 1608 at what is now Québec City?","zq":"1608 年在今天的魁北克市建造堡壘的是誰？","o":["Jacques Cartier","Samuel de Champlain","Count Frontenac","John Cabot"],"zo":["雅克・卡蒂亞","薩繆爾・德・尚普蘭","弗龍特納克伯爵","約翰・卡伯特"],"a":1,"e":"Champlain built the fortress in 1608 and allied with the Algonquin, Montagnais and Huron.","ze":"尚普蘭 1608 年建堡壘，並與阿爾岡昆、蒙塔涅和休倫族結盟。","p":5,"id":"q0093","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"In 1670, King Charles II granted exclusive trading rights over the Hudson Bay watershed to which company?","zq":"1670 年，查理二世把哈德遜灣流域的獨家貿易權授予哪家公司？","o":["The Canadian Pacific Railway","The Hudson's Bay Company","The East India Company","The North West Company"],"zo":["加拿大太平洋鐵路公司","哈德遜灣公司","東印度公司","西北公司"],"a":1,"e":"The Hudson's Bay Company competed with Montreal-based traders for 100 years.","ze":"哈德遜灣公司與蒙特婁商人競爭了一百年。","p":8,"id":"q0094","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"What was the outcome of the Battle of the Plains of Abraham in 1759?","zq":"1759 年亞伯拉罕平原戰役的結果是什麼？","o":["The French defeated the British","The British defeated the French, ending France's empire in America","It ended in a truce","The Americans won"],"zo":["法軍擊敗英軍","英軍擊敗法軍，法國在美洲的帝國結束","以休戰告終","美國人獲勝"],"a":1,"e":"Both commanders, Wolfe and Montcalm, were killed; France's empire in America ended.","ze":"雙方主將沃爾夫與蒙卡姆都陣亡；法國在美洲的帝國結束。","p":9,"id":"q0095","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"What did the Quebec Act of 1774 do?","zq":"1774 年的《魁北克法案》做了什麼？","o":["Abolished slavery","Allowed religious freedom for Catholics, let them hold public office, and restored French civil law","Created the province of Ontario","Gave women the vote"],"zo":["廢除奴隸制","允許天主教徒宗教自由與擔任公職，並恢復法國民法","建立安大略省","給予婦女投票權"],"a":1,"e":"The Quebec Act is one of the constitutional foundations of Canada.","ze":"《魁北克法案》是加拿大憲政基礎之一。","p":11,"id":"q0096","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"Who were the United Empire Loyalists?","zq":"聯合帝國效忠派是誰？","o":["French settlers in Acadia","People loyal to the Crown who fled the American Revolution to settle in Nova Scotia and Quebec","Soldiers of the War of 1812","Fathers of Confederation"],"zo":["阿卡迪亞的法國移民","效忠王室、逃離美國革命而定居新斯科細亞與魁北克的人","1812 年戰爭的士兵","聯邦之父"],"a":1,"e":"More than 40,000 Loyalists came north after 1776.","ze":"1776 年後超過四萬名效忠派北上。","p":12,"id":"q0097","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"Who led thousands of Loyalist Mohawk into Canada?","zq":"誰率領數千名效忠派莫霍克人進入加拿大？","o":["Tecumseh","Joseph Brant","Louis Riel","Isaac Brock"],"zo":["特庫姆塞","約瑟夫・布蘭特","路易・瑞爾","艾薩克・布洛克"],"a":1,"e":"Joseph Brant led thousands of Loyalist Mohawk Indians into Canada.","ze":"約瑟夫・布蘭特率領數千名效忠派莫霍克人進入加拿大。","p":12,"id":"q0098","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"Where was the first representative assembly elected, in 1758?","zq":"1758 年第一個民選代議議會在哪裡選出？","o":["Québec City","Halifax, Nova Scotia","Toronto","Charlottetown"],"zo":["魁北克市","新斯科細亞哈利法克斯","多倫多","夏洛特敦"],"a":1,"e":"Halifax in 1758; PEI followed in 1773 and New Brunswick in 1785.","ze":"1758 年在哈利法克斯；愛德華王子島 1773 年、新布藍瑞克 1785 年跟進。","p":14,"id":"q0099","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"The Constitutional Act of 1791 divided the Province of Quebec into which two parts?","zq":"1791 年《憲法法案》把魁北克省分成哪兩部分？","o":["Ontario and Manitoba","Upper Canada and Lower Canada","Acadia and New France","East Canada and West Canada"],"zo":["安大略與曼尼托巴","上加拿大與下加拿大","阿卡迪亞與新法蘭西","東加拿大與西加拿大"],"a":1,"e":"Upper Canada (later Ontario) and Lower Canada (later Quebec).","ze":"上加拿大（後來的安大略）與下加拿大（後來的魁北克）。","p":14,"id":"q0100","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"In 1793, which province became the first in the British Empire to move toward the abolition of slavery?","zq":"1793 年，哪個省成為大英帝國第一個邁向廢奴的省份？","o":["Nova Scotia","Lower Canada","Upper Canada","New Brunswick"],"zo":["新斯科細亞","下加拿大","上加拿大","新布藍瑞克"],"a":2,"e":"Upper Canada, led by Lieutenant Governor John Graves Simcoe.","ze":"上加拿大，在副總督約翰・格雷夫斯・辛科的領導下。","p":16,"id":"q0101","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"What was the Underground Railroad?","zq":"「地下鐵路」是什麼？","o":["A subway in Montreal","A Christian anti-slavery network that helped slaves escape to Canada","The Canadian Pacific Railway","A fur trade route"],"zo":["蒙特婁的地鐵","幫助奴隸逃到加拿大的基督教反奴隸網絡","加拿大太平洋鐵路","毛皮貿易路線"],"a":1,"e":"Thousands of slaves followed \"the North Star\" to Canada via the Underground Railroad.","ze":"成千上萬的奴隸跟隨「北極星」經地下鐵路來到加拿大。","p":16,"id":"q0102","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"When did the United States invade Canada, believing it would be easy to conquer?","zq":"美國以為征服加拿大很容易，在什麼時候發動入侵？","o":["June 1776","June 1812","July 1867","April 1917"],"zo":["1776 年 6 月","1812 年 6 月","1867 年 7 月","1917 年 4 月"],"a":1,"e":"The War of 1812 began with the American invasion in June 1812.","ze":"1812 年戰爭始於 1812 年 6 月美國入侵。","p":19,"id":"q0103","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"Who was killed defending Queenston Heights in 1812 after capturing Detroit?","zq":"誰在 1812 年攻下底特律後，在防守昆士頓高地時陣亡？","o":["Chief Tecumseh","Major-General Sir Isaac Brock","Charles de Salaberry","Robert Ross"],"zo":["酋長特庫姆塞","少將艾薩克・布洛克爵士","夏爾・德・薩拉貝里","羅伯特・羅斯"],"a":1,"e":"Brock captured Detroit but was killed at Queenston Heights, a battle the Americans lost.","ze":"布洛克攻下底特律，但在昆士頓高地陣亡；那場戰役美軍戰敗。","p":20,"id":"q0104","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"In 1813, Laura Secord walked 30 kilometres to do what?","zq":"1813 年，蘿拉・西科德走了 30 公里去做什麼？","o":["Deliver supplies to Detroit","Warn Lieutenant FitzGibbon of a planned American attack","Carry a message to Montreal","Escape from the Americans"],"zo":["送補給到底特律","警告費茨吉本中尉美軍即將攻擊","送信到蒙特婁","逃離美軍"],"a":1,"e":"Her bravery contributed to victory at the Battle of Beaver Dams.","ze":"她的勇敢促成了比佛丹戰役的勝利。","p":23,"id":"q0105","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"In 1814, Major-General Robert Ross led an expedition that burned down what?","zq":"1814 年，少將羅伯特・羅斯率領遠征軍燒毀了什麼？","o":["The Parliament Buildings in York","The White House in Washington, D.C.","Fort Garry","Government House in Halifax"],"zo":["約克的議會大廈","華盛頓特區的白宮","加里堡","哈利法克斯的總督府"],"a":1,"e":"In retaliation for the burning of York, Ross burned the White House and other buildings in Washington.","ze":"為報復約克被燒，羅斯燒毀了華盛頓的白宮和其他建築。","p":21,"id":"q0106","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"What does the term \"responsible government\" mean?","zq":"「責任政府」是什麼意思？","o":["The government is responsible to the King","The ministers of the Crown must have the support of a majority of the elected representatives","The Governor General governs directly","Judges make the laws"],"zo":["政府對國王負責","王室大臣必須獲得多數民選代表的支持","總督直接統治","法官制定法律"],"a":1,"e":"If the government loses a confidence vote in the assembly it must resign.","ze":"政府若在議會信任投票中落敗就必須辭職。","p":25,"id":"q0107","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"Which was the first British North American colony to attain full responsible government, in 1847–48?","zq":"1847–48 年，哪個英屬北美殖民地最早獲得完全責任政府？","o":["Province of Canada","Nova Scotia","New Brunswick","Prince Edward Island"],"zo":["加拿大省","新斯科細亞","新布藍瑞克","愛德華王子島"],"a":1,"e":"Nova Scotia in 1847–48; United Canada followed in 1848–49 under Lord Elgin.","ze":"新斯科細亞 1847–48 年；聯合加拿大 1848–49 年在額爾金勳爵下跟進。","p":28,"id":"q0108","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"Who became the first leader of a responsible government in the Canadas?","zq":"誰成為加拿大第一位責任政府的領袖？","o":["Sir John A. Macdonald","Sir Louis-Hippolyte La Fontaine","Lord Durham","Sir George-Étienne Cartier"],"zo":["約翰・A・麥克唐納爵士","路易－伊波利特・拉方丹爵士","德倫勳爵","喬治－艾蒂安・卡蒂埃爵士"],"a":1,"e":"La Fontaine was a champion of democracy and French language rights.","ze":"拉方丹是民主與法語權利的捍衛者。","p":29,"id":"q0109","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"When was the Dominion of Canada officially born?","zq":"加拿大自治領在什麼時候正式誕生？","o":["July 1, 1867","July 4, 1776","January 1, 1901","April 17, 1982"],"zo":["1867 年 7 月 1 日","1776 年 7 月 4 日","1901 年 1 月 1 日","1982 年 4 月 17 日"],"a":0,"e":"The British Parliament passed the British North America Act in 1867; July 1 is now Canada Day.","ze":"英國國會 1867 年通過《英屬北美法案》；7 月 1 日現在是加拿大日。","p":31,"id":"q0110","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"Which four provinces formed the Dominion of Canada in 1867?","zq":"1867 年哪四個省組成加拿大自治領？","o":["Ontario, Quebec, Manitoba, British Columbia","Ontario, Quebec, New Brunswick, Nova Scotia","Quebec, Nova Scotia, PEI, Newfoundland","Ontario, Alberta, Saskatchewan, Manitoba"],"zo":["安大略、魁北克、曼尼托巴、卑詩","安大略、魁北克、新布藍瑞克、新斯科細亞","魁北克、新斯科細亞、愛德華王子島、紐芬蘭","安大略、亞伯達、薩克其萬、曼尼托巴"],"a":1,"e":"The old Province of Canada was split into Ontario and Quebec, which joined New Brunswick and Nova Scotia.","ze":"原加拿大省拆成安大略與魁北克，加上新布藍瑞克與新斯科細亞。","p":30,"id":"q0111","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"Until 1982, July 1 was celebrated as what?","zq":"1982 年以前，7 月 1 日被稱為什麼？","o":["Confederation Day","Dominion Day","Victoria Day","Empire Day"],"zo":["聯邦日","自治領日","維多利亞日","帝國日"],"a":1,"e":"Dominion Day; today it is officially Canada Day.","ze":"自治領日；今天正式稱為加拿大日。","p":31,"id":"q0112","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"Who suggested the term \"Dominion of Canada\" in 1864, inspired by Psalm 72?","zq":"1864 年誰受《詩篇》72 篇啟發，提議「加拿大自治領」這個名稱？","o":["Sir Leonard Tilley","Sir John A. Macdonald","Sir George-Étienne Cartier","Lord Durham"],"zo":["李奧納德・蒂利爵士","約翰・A・麥克唐納爵士","喬治－艾蒂安・卡蒂埃爵士","德倫勳爵"],"a":0,"e":"Tilley, a Father of Confederation from New Brunswick, took \"dominion from sea to sea\" from Psalm 72.","ze":"來自新布藍瑞克的聯邦之父蒂利，取自《詩篇》72 篇「從這海直到那海」。","p":32,"id":"q0113","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"Who was Canada's first Prime Minister?","zq":"加拿大第一任總理是誰？","o":["Sir Wilfrid Laurier","Sir John Alexander Macdonald","Sir Robert Borden","William Lyon Mackenzie King"],"zo":["威爾弗里德・勞里埃爵士","約翰・亞歷山大・麥克唐納爵士","羅伯特・博登爵士","威廉・萊昂・麥肯齊・金"],"a":1,"e":"Macdonald, born in Scotland, became Prime Minister in 1867; his portrait is on the $10 bill.","ze":"生於蘇格蘭的麥克唐納 1867 年成為總理；肖像在 10 元鈔票上。","p":33,"id":"q0114","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"Which date is Sir John A. Macdonald Day?","zq":"約翰・A・麥克唐納爵士日是哪一天？","o":["January 1","January 11","July 1","November 20"],"zo":["1 月 1 日","1 月 11 日","7 月 1 日","11 月 20 日"],"a":1,"e":"Parliament recognized January 11, his birthday, as Sir John A. Macdonald Day.","ze":"國會將他的生日 1 月 11 日定為麥克唐納爵士日。","p":33,"id":"q0115","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"Who led the Métis uprising at Red River in 1869–70 and is seen by many as the father of Manitoba?","zq":"誰領導 1869–70 年紅河的梅蒂人起義，並被許多人視為曼尼托巴之父？","o":["Tecumseh","Louis Riel","Joseph Brant","Sam Steele"],"zo":["特庫姆塞","路易・瑞爾","約瑟夫・布蘭特","山姆・斯蒂爾"],"a":1,"e":"Riel seized Fort Garry; Manitoba became a province in 1870; Riel was executed after the 1885 rebellion.","ze":"瑞爾奪取加里堡；曼尼托巴 1870 年建省；瑞爾在 1885 年叛亂後被處決。","p":36,"id":"q0116","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"In 1873, Prime Minister Macdonald established which police force to pacify the West?","zq":"1873 年麥克唐納總理成立哪支警察部隊以平定西部？","o":["The Ontario Provincial Police","The North West Mounted Police (NWMP)","The Canadian Rangers","The Coast Guard"],"zo":["安大略省警","西北騎警（NWMP）","加拿大巡邏隊","海岸防衛隊"],"a":1,"e":"The NWMP became today's RCMP, one of Canada's best-known symbols; Regina became its headquarters.","ze":"西北騎警就是今天的皇家騎警，加拿大最知名的象徵之一；總部設在里賈納。","p":38,"id":"q0117","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"On what date was the last spike of the Canadian Pacific Railway driven?","zq":"加拿大太平洋鐵路的最後一根道釘在哪一天敲下？","o":["July 1, 1867","November 7, 1885","April 9, 1917","June 6, 1944"],"zo":["1867 年 7 月 1 日","1885 年 11 月 7 日","1917 年 4 月 9 日","1944 年 6 月 6 日"],"a":1,"e":"Donald Smith (Lord Strathcona) drove the last spike on November 7, 1885.","ze":"唐納德・史密斯（史特拉斯科納勳爵）在 1885 年 11 月 7 日敲下最後一根道釘。","p":39,"id":"q0118","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"What was the Head Tax?","zq":"「人頭稅」是什麼？","o":["A tax on railway tickets","A race-based entry fee imposed on Chinese immigrants","A tax on farmland","A fee to vote"],"zo":["火車票稅","對華人移民徵收的、以種族為依據的入境費","農地稅","投票費"],"a":1,"e":"The Government of Canada apologized in 2006 for this discriminatory policy.","ze":"加拿大政府在 2006 年為這項歧視政策道歉。","p":39,"id":"q0119","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"Who became the first French-Canadian prime minister since Confederation?","zq":"誰是聯邦成立以來第一位法裔加拿大總理？","o":["Sir George-Étienne Cartier","Sir Wilfrid Laurier","Louis St-Laurent","Pierre Trudeau"],"zo":["喬治－艾蒂安・卡蒂埃爵士","威爾弗里德・勞里埃爵士","路易・聖羅倫","皮埃爾・杜魯道"],"a":1,"e":"Laurier encouraged immigration to the West; his portrait is on the $5 bill.","ze":"勞里埃鼓勵移民西部；肖像在 5 元鈔票上。","p":41,"id":"q0120","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"Which province was the first to grant voting rights to women, in 1916?","zq":"1916 年哪個省最早給予婦女投票權？","o":["Ontario","Quebec","Manitoba","British Columbia"],"zo":["安大略","魁北克","曼尼托巴","卑詩"],"a":2,"e":"Manitoba in 1916; most women got the federal vote in 1918; Quebec in 1940.","ze":"曼尼托巴 1916 年；多數婦女 1918 年獲聯邦投票權；魁北克 1940 年。","p":42,"id":"q0121","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"Who founded the women's suffrage movement in Canada?","zq":"誰創立了加拿大的婦女參政運動？","o":["Agnes Macphail","Dr. Emily Stowe","Thérèse Casgrain","Laura Secord"],"zo":["艾格妮絲・麥克費爾","艾蜜莉・斯托醫師","泰蕾茲・卡斯格蘭","蘿拉・西科德"],"a":1,"e":"Dr. Emily Stowe was the first Canadian woman to practise medicine in Canada.","ze":"艾蜜莉・斯托醫師是第一位在加拿大執業的加拿大女醫師。","p":42,"id":"q0122","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"Who became the first woman MP, in 1921?","zq":"1921 年誰成為第一位女性國會議員？","o":["Agnes Macphail","Emily Stowe","Nellie McClung","Thérèse Casgrain"],"zo":["艾格妮絲・麥克費爾","艾蜜莉・斯托","內莉・麥克隆","泰蕾茲・卡斯格蘭"],"a":0,"e":"Agnes Macphail, a farmer and teacher, was elected in 1921.","ze":"農民兼教師艾格妮絲・麥克費爾在 1921 年當選。","p":43,"id":"q0123","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"What battle in April 1917 secured the Canadians' reputation as the \"shock troops of the British Empire\"?","zq":"1917 年 4 月哪場戰役為加拿大人贏得「大英帝國突擊部隊」的美名？","o":["The Battle of Amiens","The Battle of Vimy Ridge","The Battle of the Atlantic","D-Day"],"zo":["亞眠戰役","維米嶺戰役","大西洋戰役","D 日"],"a":1,"e":"April 9 is celebrated as Vimy Day.","ze":"4 月 9 日是維米日。","p":46,"id":"q0124","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"How many Canadians served in the First World War, out of a population of eight million?","zq":"在八百萬人口中，有多少加拿大人參加第一次世界大戰？","o":["60,000","260,000","More than 600,000","Over one million"],"zo":["6 萬","26 萬","超過 60 萬","超過 100 萬"],"a":2,"e":"More than 600,000 served; 60,000 were killed and 170,000 wounded.","ze":"超過 60 萬人服役；6 萬人陣亡，17 萬人受傷。","p":45,"id":"q0125","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"On which date and time do Canadians observe a moment of silence on Remembrance Day?","zq":"國殤紀念日加拿大人在什麼日期和時間默哀？","o":["July 1 at noon","November 11 at 11 a.m.","April 9 at 9 a.m.","June 6 at 6 a.m."],"zo":["7 月 1 日中午","11 月 11 日上午 11 時","4 月 9 日上午 9 時","6 月 6 日上午 6 時"],"a":1,"e":"The 11th hour of the 11th day of the 11th month; Canadians wear the red poppy.","ze":"11 月 11 日 11 時；加拿大人佩戴紅色罌粟花。","p":49,"id":"q0126","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"Who composed the poem \"In Flanders Fields\" in 1915?","zq":"1915 年誰寫下詩作〈在法蘭德斯戰場〉？","o":["Robert W. Service","Lieutenant-Colonel John McCrae","Sir Arthur Currie","Stephen Leacock"],"zo":["羅伯特・W・瑟維斯","約翰・麥克雷中校","亞瑟・柯里爵士","史蒂芬・里柯克"],"a":1,"e":"John McCrae was a Canadian medical officer.","ze":"約翰・麥克雷是加拿大軍醫。","p":50,"id":"q0127","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"Unemployment reached what level in 1933 during the Great Depression?","zq":"大蕭條期間，1933 年失業率達到多少？","o":["7%","15%","27%","50%"],"zo":["7%","15%","27%","50%"],"a":2,"e":"Unemployment reached 27% in 1933; the Bank of Canada was created in 1934.","ze":"1933 年失業率達 27%；加拿大銀行 1934 年成立。","p":55,"id":"q0128","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"About how many Canadians were killed in the Second World War?","zq":"第二次世界大戰約有多少加拿大人陣亡？","o":["4,400","44,000","60,000","110,000"],"zo":["4,400","44,000","60,000","110,000"],"a":1,"e":"More than one million served out of 11.5 million; 44,000 were killed.","ze":"1,150 萬人口中超過 100 萬人服役；44,000 人陣亡。","p":58,"id":"q0129","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"On D-Day, June 6, 1944, 15,000 Canadian troops stormed and captured which beach?","zq":"1944 年 6 月 6 日 D 日，15,000 名加拿大士兵強攻並奪下哪個海灘？","o":["Omaha Beach","Juno Beach","Sword Beach","Dieppe"],"zo":["奧馬哈海灘","朱諾海灘","劍灘","迪耶普"],"a":1,"e":"Approximately one in ten Allied soldiers on D-Day was Canadian.","ze":"D 日盟軍每十名士兵約有一名是加拿大人。","p":62,"id":"q0130","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"At the end of the Second World War, Canada had the world's what?","zq":"第二次世界大戰結束時，加拿大擁有世界的什麼？","o":["Largest army","Third-largest navy","Largest air force","Only nuclear weapons"],"zo":["最大的陸軍","第三大的海軍","最大的空軍","唯一的核武"],"a":1,"e":"The Royal Canadian Navy saw its finest hour in the Battle of the Atlantic.","ze":"皇家加拿大海軍在大西洋戰役中迎來最光榮的時刻。","p":60,"id":"q0131","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"04","q":"In what year did the Government of Canada apologize for the wartime relocation of Japanese Canadians?","zq":"加拿大政府在哪一年為戰時遷移日裔加拿大人道歉？","o":["1945","1960","1988","2006"],"zo":["1945","1960","1988","2006"],"a":2,"e":"The government apologized in 1988 for wartime wrongs and compensated the victims.","ze":"政府在 1988 年為戰時錯誤道歉並補償受害者。","p":61,"id":"q0132","slug":"04-canadas-history"},{"ch":"05","q":"The discovery of oil in which province in 1947 began Canada's modern energy industry?","zq":"1947 年在哪個省發現石油，開啟了加拿大的現代能源產業？","o":["Ontario","Alberta","Newfoundland","Saskatchewan"],"zo":["安大略","亞伯達","紐芬蘭","薩克其萬"],"a":1,"e":"Oil was discovered in Alberta in 1947.","ze":"1947 年在亞伯達發現石油。","p":0,"id":"q0133","slug":"05-modern-canada"},{"ch":"05","q":"Old Age Security was devised as early as which year?","zq":"老年保障金最早在哪一年設立？","o":["1867","1927","1940","1965"],"zo":["1867","1927","1940","1965"],"a":1,"e":"Old Age Security 1927; unemployment insurance 1940; Canada and Quebec Pension Plans 1965.","ze":"老年保障金 1927 年；失業保險 1940 年；退休金計畫 1965 年。","p":1,"id":"q0134","slug":"05-modern-canada"},{"ch":"05","q":"Canada joined which military alliance with other Western democracies during the Cold War?","zq":"冷戰期間加拿大與其他西方民主國家加入哪個軍事同盟？","o":["The Warsaw Pact","NATO","The United Nations","The G8"],"zo":["華沙公約","北約（NATO）","聯合國","G8"],"a":1,"e":"Canada helped form NATO and joined the United States in NORAD.","ze":"加拿大協助組成北約，並與美國組成北美航太防禦司令部。","p":3,"id":"q0135","slug":"05-modern-canada"},{"ch":"05","q":"In the Korean War (1950–53), how many Canadians died?","zq":"韓戰（1950–53）有多少加拿大人陣亡？","o":["500","1,000","5,000","44,000"],"zo":["500","1,000","5,000","44,000"],"a":0,"e":"500 dead and 1,000 wounded in the UN operation defending South Korea.","ze":"在聯合國保衛南韓的行動中 500 人陣亡、1,000 人受傷。","p":4,"id":"q0136","slug":"05-modern-canada"},{"ch":"05","q":"What is the name of Quebec's era of rapid change in the 1960s?","zq":"魁北克 1960 年代快速變革的時期叫什麼？","o":["The Great Upheaval","The Quiet Revolution","The Roaring Twenties","The Confederation"],"zo":["大動盪","寧靜革命","咆哮的二〇年代","聯邦"],"a":1,"e":"During the Quiet Revolution many Quebecers sought to separate from Canada.","ze":"寧靜革命期間許多魁北克人尋求脫離加拿大。","p":5,"id":"q0137","slug":"05-modern-canada"},{"ch":"05","q":"What did the Official Languages Act of 1969 guarantee?","zq":"1969 年《官方語言法》保障了什麼？","o":["French and English services in the federal government across Canada","Free language classes","Bilingual provinces","English-only schools"],"zo":["聯邦政府在全加拿大提供法語和英語服務","免費語言課程","雙語省份","純英語學校"],"a":0,"e":"The Act followed the Royal Commission on Bilingualism and Biculturalism.","ze":"這部法律源自雙語與雙文化皇家委員會。","p":5,"id":"q0138","slug":"05-modern-canada"},{"ch":"05","q":"In which years were the two Quebec sovereignty referendums defeated?","zq":"魁北克主權公投在哪兩年失敗？","o":["1970 and 1982","1980 and 1995","1967 and 1990","1985 and 2000"],"zo":["1970 和 1982","1980 和 1995","1967 和 1990","1985 和 2000"],"a":1,"e":"Sovereignty was defeated in 1980 and again in 1995.","ze":"主權運動在 1980 年和 1995 年兩次公投中失敗。","p":6,"id":"q0139","slug":"05-modern-canada"},{"ch":"05","q":"In what year were Aboriginal people granted the vote?","zq":"原住民在哪一年獲得投票權？","a":2,"o":["1918","1948","1960","1982"],"zo":["1918","1948","1960","1982"],"e":"Japanese-Canadians gained the vote in 1948, Aboriginal people in 1960.","ze":"日裔加拿大人 1948 年、原住民 1960 年獲得投票權。","p":8,"id":"q0140","slug":"05-modern-canada"},{"ch":"05","q":"About how many Vietnamese refugees sought refuge in Canada after 1975?","zq":"1975 年後約有多少越南難民到加拿大尋求庇護？","o":["5,000","37,000","Over 50,000","One million"],"zo":["5,000","37,000","超過 50,000","一百萬"],"a":2,"e":"Over 50,000 Vietnamese; earlier about 37,000 Hungarians in 1956.","ze":"超過五萬名越南人；更早 1956 年有約三萬七千名匈牙利人。","p":9,"id":"q0141","slug":"05-modern-canada"},{"ch":"05","q":"The Group of Seven, founded in 1920, is famous for what?","zq":"1920 年成立的「七人畫派」以什麼聞名？","o":["Inuit sculpture","Painting the rugged wilderness landscapes","Modern abstract art","Film making"],"zo":["因紐特雕塑","描繪粗獷的荒野景色","現代抽象藝術","電影製作"],"a":1,"e":"The Group of Seven developed a style of painting to capture the rugged wilderness.","ze":"七人畫派發展出捕捉粗獷荒野的繪畫風格。","p":13,"id":"q0142","slug":"05-modern-canada"},{"ch":"05","q":"Who invented basketball in 1891?","zq":"1891 年誰發明了籃球？","o":["Wayne Gretzky","James Naismith","Terry Fox","Donovan Bailey"],"zo":["韋恩・格雷茨基","詹姆斯・奈史密斯","泰瑞・福克斯","多諾萬・貝利"],"a":1,"e":"Basketball was invented by Canadian James Naismith.","ze":"籃球是加拿大人詹姆斯・奈史密斯發明的。","p":16,"id":"q0143","slug":"05-modern-canada"},{"ch":"05","q":"Terry Fox's 1980 cross-country run to raise money for cancer research was called what?","zq":"泰瑞・福克斯 1980 年為癌症研究募款的橫越全國長跑叫什麼？","o":["The Run for the Cure","The Marathon of Hope","The Great Canadian Run","The Terry Fox Trail"],"zo":["治癒之跑","希望馬拉松","大加拿大長跑","泰瑞・福克斯步道"],"a":1,"e":"Terry Fox, who lost his right leg to cancer at 18, became a hero to Canadians.","ze":"18 歲因癌症失去右腿的泰瑞・福克斯成為加拿大人的英雄。","p":17,"id":"q0144","slug":"05-modern-canada"},{"ch":"05","q":"Which Canadian inventors invented the first electric light bulb and later sold the patent to Thomas Edison?","zq":"哪兩位加拿大發明家發明了第一個電燈泡，後來把專利賣給愛迪生？","o":["Bell and Fessenden","Matthew Evans and Henry Woodward","Banting and Best","Lazaridis and Balsillie"],"zo":["貝爾與費森登","馬修・伊凡斯與亨利・伍德沃德","班廷與貝斯特","拉扎里迪斯與巴爾西利"],"a":1,"e":"Edison, more famously, commercialized the light bulb.","ze":"愛迪生更有名地將電燈泡商業化。","p":20,"id":"q0145","slug":"05-modern-canada"},{"ch":"05","q":"Who invented the worldwide system of standard time zones?","zq":"誰發明了全球標準時區系統？","o":["Alexander Graham Bell","Sir Sandford Fleming","Joseph-Armand Bombardier","Reginald Fessenden"],"zo":["亞歷山大・格拉漢姆・貝爾","桑福德・弗萊明爵士","約瑟夫－阿爾芒・龐巴迪","雷金納德・費森登"],"a":1,"e":"Sir Sandford Fleming invented the standard time zone system.","ze":"桑福德・弗萊明爵士發明了標準時區系統。","p":20,"id":"q0146","slug":"05-modern-canada"},{"ch":"05","q":"What did Sir Frederick Banting and Charles Best discover?","zq":"弗雷德里克・班廷爵士和查爾斯・貝斯特發現了什麼？","o":["The telephone","The cardiac pacemaker","Insulin","The Canadarm"],"zo":["電話","心律調節器","胰島素","加拿大臂"],"a":2,"e":"Insulin, a hormone to treat diabetes, has saved 16 million lives worldwide.","ze":"治療糖尿病的荷爾蒙胰島素，拯救了全球 1,600 萬條生命。","p":20,"id":"q0147","slug":"05-modern-canada"},{"ch":"05","q":"Who invented the first cardiac pacemaker?","zq":"誰發明了第一個心律調節器？","o":["Dr. Wilder Penfield","Dr. John A. Hopps","Sir Frederick Banting","Mike Lazaridis"],"zo":["懷爾德・潘菲爾德醫師","約翰・A・霍普斯醫師","弗雷德里克・班廷爵士","麥克・拉扎里迪斯"],"a":1,"e":"Dr. John A. Hopps invented the first cardiac pacemaker.","ze":"約翰・A・霍普斯醫師發明了第一個心律調節器。","p":20,"id":"q0148","slug":"05-modern-canada"},{"ch":"05","q":"What is the Canadarm?","zq":"「加拿大臂」是什麼？","o":["A hockey trophy","A robotic arm used in outer space","A snowmobile","A wireless phone"],"zo":["曲棍球獎盃","用於外太空的機械手臂","雪上摩托車","無線電話"],"a":1,"e":"Invented by SPAR Aerospace and the National Research Council.","ze":"由 SPAR 航太公司和國家研究委員會發明。","p":20,"id":"q0149","slug":"05-modern-canada"},{"ch":"06","q":"What are the three key facts about Canada's system of government?","zq":"關於加拿大政府制度的三個關鍵事實是什麼？","o":["A republic, a democracy and a union","A federal state, a parliamentary democracy and a constitutional monarchy","A monarchy, an empire and a colony","A federation, a presidency and a senate"],"zo":["共和國、民主國、聯合體","聯邦國家、議會民主國、君主立憲國","君主國、帝國、殖民地","聯邦、總統制、參議院"],"a":1,"e":"Canada is a federal state, a parliamentary democracy and a constitutional monarchy.","ze":"加拿大是聯邦國家、議會民主國，也是君主立憲國。","p":0,"id":"q0150","slug":"06-how-canadians-govern"},{"ch":"06","q":"Which of the following is a responsibility of the federal government?","zq":"下列哪一項是聯邦政府的職責？","o":["Education","Highways","National defence and foreign policy","Municipal government"],"zo":["教育","公路","國防與外交政策","市鎮政府"],"a":2,"e":"Federal: defence, foreign policy, interprovincial trade, currency, navigation, criminal law, citizenship.","ze":"聯邦：國防、外交、省際貿易、貨幣、航運、刑法、公民身分。","p":2,"id":"q0151","slug":"06-how-canadians-govern"},{"ch":"06","q":"Which two areas do the federal government and the provinces share jurisdiction over?","zq":"聯邦政府與各省共同管轄哪兩個領域？","o":["Defence and currency","Agriculture and immigration","Education and health","Criminal law and citizenship"],"zo":["國防與貨幣","農業與移民","教育與醫療","刑法與公民身分"],"a":1,"e":"Agriculture and immigration are shared responsibilities.","ze":"農業和移民是共同職責。","p":2,"id":"q0152","slug":"06-how-canadians-govern"},{"ch":"06","q":"What are the three parts of Parliament?","zq":"國會由哪三部分組成？","o":["The Prime Minister, the Cabinet and the Senate","The Sovereign, the Senate and the House of Commons","The Governor General, the courts and the provinces","The King, the Prime Minister and the Supreme Court"],"zo":["總理、內閣和參議院","君主、參議院和眾議院","總督、法院和各省","國王、總理和最高法院"],"a":1,"e":"Parliament has three parts: the Sovereign, the Senate and the House of Commons.","ze":"國會三部分：君主、參議院、眾議院。","p":5,"id":"q0153","slug":"06-how-canadians-govern"},{"ch":"06","q":"Senators are appointed by the Governor General on the advice of whom, and serve until what age?","zq":"參議員由總督依誰的建議任命？任職到幾歲？","o":["The Sovereign; 65","The Prime Minister; 75","The Supreme Court; 70","The provinces; 80"],"zo":["君主；65 歲","總理；75 歲","最高法院；70 歲","各省；80 歲"],"a":1,"e":"Senators are appointed on the advice of the Prime Minister and serve until age 75.","ze":"參議員依總理建議任命，任職到 75 歲。","p":6,"id":"q0154","slug":"06-how-canadians-govern"},{"ch":"06","q":"What is the first step in how a bill becomes law?","zq":"法案成為法律的第一步是什麼？","o":["Royal Assent","Committee Stage","First Reading — the bill is considered read for the first time and printed","Third Reading"],"zo":["御准","委員會階段","一讀——法案視為第一次宣讀並印製","三讀"],"a":2,"e":"First Reading, Second Reading, Committee Stage, Report Stage, Third Reading, Senate, Royal Assent.","ze":"一讀、二讀、委員會、報告、三讀、參議院、御准。","p":7,"id":"q0155","slug":"06-how-canadians-govern"},{"ch":"06","q":"What is the final step for a bill to become law?","zq":"法案成為法律的最後一步是什麼？","o":["Third Reading","Royal Assent granted by the Governor General on behalf of the Sovereign","A national referendum","Approval by the Supreme Court"],"zo":["三讀","總督代表君主授予御准","全國公投","最高法院批准"],"a":1,"e":"No bill becomes law until passed by both chambers and given royal assent.","ze":"法案須經兩院通過並獲御准才成為法律。","p":6,"id":"q0156","slug":"06-how-canadians-govern"},{"ch":"06","q":"Who is Canada's Head of State?","zq":"誰是加拿大的國家元首？","o":["The Prime Minister","The Governor General","The Sovereign (King or Queen)","The Chief Justice"],"zo":["總理","總督","君主（國王或女王）","首席大法官"],"a":2,"e":"The Sovereign is head of state; the Prime Minister is head of government.","ze":"君主是國家元首；總理是政府首長。","p":9,"id":"q0157","slug":"06-how-canadians-govern"},{"ch":"06","q":"Who represents the Sovereign in Canada, and for how long is the appointment usually?","zq":"誰在加拿大代表君主？任期通常多久？","o":["The Prime Minister; four years","The Governor General; five years","The Chief Justice; ten years","The Speaker; one year"],"zo":["總理；四年","總督；五年","首席大法官；十年","議長；一年"],"a":1,"e":"The Governor General is appointed by the Sovereign on the advice of the Prime Minister, usually for five years.","ze":"總督由君主依總理建議任命，通常五年。","p":11,"id":"q0158","slug":"06-how-canadians-govern"},{"ch":"06","q":"Who represents the Sovereign in each of the ten provinces?","zq":"誰在十個省中代表君主？","o":["The Premier","The Lieutenant Governor","The Commissioner","The Mayor"],"zo":["省長","省督","專員","市長"],"a":1,"e":"The Lieutenant Governor, appointed by the Governor General on the advice of the Prime Minister.","ze":"省督，由總督依總理建議任命。","p":11,"id":"q0159","slug":"06-how-canadians-govern"},{"ch":"06","q":"In the three territories, who represents the federal government?","zq":"在三個地區，誰代表聯邦政府？","o":["The Lieutenant Governor","The Commissioner","The Premier","The Governor General"],"zo":["省督","專員","省長","總督"],"a":1,"e":"The Commissioner plays a ceremonial role in each territory.","ze":"專員在各地區扮演儀式性角色。","p":14,"id":"q0160","slug":"06-how-canadians-govern"},{"ch":"06","q":"What are the three branches of government?","zq":"政府的三個部門是什麼？","o":["Federal, provincial and municipal","Executive, Legislative and Judicial","Senate, Commons and Crown","Police, courts and prisons"],"zo":["聯邦、省與市鎮","行政、立法與司法","參議院、眾議院與王權","警察、法院與監獄"],"a":1,"e":"The three branches work together but also sometimes in creative tension.","ze":"三部門既合作又時有良性張力。","p":12,"id":"q0161","slug":"06-how-canadians-govern"},{"ch":"06","q":"In Ontario, members of the provincial legislature are called what?","zq":"在安大略，省議會的議員叫什麼？","o":["MLAs","MNAs","MPPs","MHAs"],"zo":["MLA","MNA","MPP","MHA"],"a":2,"e":"Members of the Provincial Parliament (MPPs) in Ontario; MNAs in Quebec; MLAs or MHAs elsewhere.","ze":"安大略是省議會議員（MPP）；魁北克 MNA；其他省 MLA 或 MHA。","p":13,"id":"q0162","slug":"06-how-canadians-govern"},{"ch":"06","q":"Laws passed by a municipal council that affect only the local community are called what?","zq":"市鎮議會通過、只影響當地社區的法律叫什麼？","o":["Acts","By-laws","Charters","Regulations"],"zo":["法案","地方法規（by-laws）","憲章","規章"],"a":1,"e":"Municipal councils usually include a mayor (or reeve) and councillors.","ze":"市鎮議會通常包括市長（或鄉長）和議員。","p":16,"id":"q0163","slug":"06-how-canadians-govern"},{"ch":"06","q":"Which level of government is responsible for snow removal, firefighting and public transit?","zq":"哪一級政府負責除雪、消防和大眾運輸？","o":["Federal","Provincial","Municipal (local)","Territorial"],"zo":["聯邦","省","市鎮（地方）","地區"],"a":2,"e":"Municipalities handle urban planning, roads, garbage, snow removal, firefighting, transit and more.","ze":"市鎮負責都市規劃、道路、垃圾、除雪、消防、大眾運輸等。","p":16,"id":"q0164","slug":"06-how-canadians-govern"},{"ch":"06","q":"Who has major responsibilities on First Nations reserves, including housing and schools?","zq":"誰在第一民族保留區負有住房、學校等重大責任？","o":["The Governor General","Band chiefs and councillors","The RCMP","The Lieutenant Governor"],"zo":["總督","部落酋長和議員","皇家騎警","省督"],"a":1,"e":"First Nations have band chiefs and councillors with major responsibilities on reserves.","ze":"第一民族有部落酋長和議員，在保留區負有重大責任。","p":18,"id":"q0165","slug":"06-how-canadians-govern"},{"ch":"06","q":"Cabinet ministers must retain the \"confidence of the House\" and resign if they lose what?","zq":"內閣部長必須維持「眾議院的信任」，若輸掉什麼就要辭職？","o":["A general election","A non-confidence vote","A Senate vote","A court case"],"zo":["大選","不信任投票","參議院投票","官司"],"a":1,"e":"Cabinet ministers are responsible to the elected representatives.","ze":"內閣部長對民選代表負責。","p":4,"id":"q0166","slug":"06-how-canadians-govern"},{"ch":"05","q":"In 1951, for the first time, a majority of Canadians were able to afford what?","zq":"1951 年，大多數加拿大人第一次能夠負擔什麼？","o":["Cars and televisions","Adequate food, shelter and clothing","University education","Foreign travel"],"zo":["汽車和電視","足夠的食物、住所和衣物","大學教育","出國旅行"],"a":1,"e":"Postwar Canada enjoyed record prosperity.","ze":"戰後加拿大享有空前的繁榮。","p":0,"id":"q0167","slug":"05-modern-canada"},{"ch":"05","q":"Which Act ensures common elements and a basic standard of health coverage?","zq":"哪部法律確保醫療保障的共同要素和基本標準？","o":["The Canada Health Act","The Official Languages Act","The Constitution Act","The Citizenship Act"],"zo":["《加拿大健康法》","《官方語言法》","《憲法法案》","《公民法》"],"a":0,"e":"Publicly funded education, by contrast, is provided by the provinces and territories.","ze":"公費教育則由各省和地區提供。","p":1,"id":"q0168","slug":"05-modern-canada"},{"ch":"05","q":"In what year did Canada help found La Francophonie?","zq":"加拿大在哪一年協助創立法語國家組織？","o":["1960","1970","1980","1995"],"zo":["1960","1970","1980","1995"],"a":1,"e":"La Francophonie is an international association of French-speaking countries.","ze":"法語國家組織是法語國家的國際組織。","p":5,"id":"q0169","slug":"05-modern-canada"},{"ch":"05","q":"In 1982 the Constitution was amended without the agreement of which province?","zq":"1982 年憲法在未獲哪個省同意的情況下修訂？","o":["Ontario","Quebec","Alberta","Nova Scotia"],"zo":["安大略","魁北克","亞伯達","新斯科細亞"],"a":1,"e":"The autonomy of Quebec within Canada remains a lively topic.","ze":"魁北克在加拿大之內的自主權仍是熱門話題。","p":6,"id":"q0170","slug":"05-modern-canada"},{"ch":"05","q":"In which year did Japanese-Canadians, the last group of Asian descent, gain the right to vote?","zq":"日裔加拿大人——最後一批亞裔——在哪一年獲得投票權？","o":["1918","1948","1960","1971"],"zo":["1918","1948","1960","1971"],"a":1,"e":"Most Canadians of Asian descent had been denied the vote in the past.","ze":"過去大多數亞裔加拿大人被剝奪投票權。","p":8,"id":"q0171","slug":"05-modern-canada"},{"ch":"05","q":"Who painted the forests and Aboriginal artifacts of the West Coast?","zq":"誰描繪了西海岸的森林和原住民文物？","o":["Tom Thomson","Emily Carr","Jean-Paul Riopelle","Kenojuak Ashevak"],"zo":["湯姆・湯姆森","艾蜜莉・卡爾","尚－保羅・里奧佩爾","肯諾朱阿克・阿舍瓦克"],"a":1,"e":"Kenojuak Ashevak pioneered modern Inuit art; Riopelle led Les Automatistes.","ze":"阿舍瓦克開創現代因紐特藝術；里奧佩爾領導自動主義畫派。","p":13,"id":"q0172","slug":"05-modern-canada"},{"ch":"05","q":"Who became a world record sprinter and double Olympic gold medallist in 1996?","zq":"1996 年誰成為短跑世界紀錄保持人和奧運雙金得主？","o":["Wayne Gretzky","Donovan Bailey","Rick Hansen","Paul Henderson"],"zo":["韋恩・格雷茨基","多諾萬・貝利","瑞克・韓森","保羅・亨德森"],"a":1,"e":"Chantal Petitclerc became a world champion wheelchair racer.","ze":"尚塔爾・珀蒂克萊爾成為輪椅競速世界冠軍。","p":16,"id":"q0173","slug":"05-modern-canada"},{"ch":"05","q":"In 1985, who circled the globe in a wheelchair to raise funds for spinal cord research?","zq":"1985 年誰坐輪椅環繞全球為脊髓研究募款？","o":["Terry Fox","Rick Hansen","Chantal Petitclerc","Mark Tewksbury"],"zo":["泰瑞・福克斯","瑞克・韓森","尚塔爾・珀蒂克萊爾","馬克・圖克斯伯里"],"a":1,"e":"Rick Hansen, like Terry Fox, was from British Columbia.","ze":"瑞克・韓森和泰瑞・福克斯一樣來自卑詩省。","p":17,"id":"q0174","slug":"05-modern-canada"},{"ch":"05","q":"Who hit on the idea of the telephone at his summer house in Canada?","zq":"誰在他加拿大的避暑住宅想出了電話的點子？","o":["Alexander Graham Bell","Reginald Fessenden","Sir Sandford Fleming","John Polanyi"],"zo":["亞歷山大・格拉漢姆・貝爾","雷金納德・費森登","桑福德・弗萊明爵士","約翰・波蘭尼"],"a":0,"e":"Reginald Fessenden sent the first wireless voice message in the world.","ze":"雷金納德・費森登發送了世界第一則無線語音訊息。","p":20,"id":"q0175","slug":"05-modern-canada"},{"ch":"05","q":"Who invented the snowmobile?","zq":"誰發明了雪上摩托車？","o":["Joseph-Armand Bombardier","Mike Lazaridis","Dr. Wilder Penfield","Harold Innis"],"zo":["約瑟夫－阿爾芒・龐巴迪","麥克・拉扎里迪斯","懷爾德・潘菲爾德醫師","哈羅德・英尼斯"],"a":0,"e":"The snowmobile is a light-weight winter vehicle.","ze":"雪上摩托車是輕型的冬季交通工具。","p":20,"id":"q0176","slug":"05-modern-canada"},{"ch":"06","q":"The responsibilities of the federal and provincial governments were defined in 1867 in which Act?","zq":"聯邦與省政府的職責在 1867 年由哪部法案訂定？","o":["The Quebec Act","The British North America Act, now the Constitution Act, 1867","The Official Languages Act","The Citizenship Act"],"zo":["《魁北克法案》","《英屬北美法案》，現稱《1867 年憲法法案》","《官方語言法》","《公民法》"],"a":1,"e":"Federalism lets provinces adopt policies tailored to their populations.","ze":"聯邦制讓各省能採用適合自己人口的政策。","p":1,"id":"q0177","slug":"06-how-canadians-govern"},{"ch":"06","q":"Which of these is a provincial responsibility?","zq":"下列哪一項是省的職責？","o":["Foreign policy","Currency","Education and health","Navigation"],"zo":["外交政策","貨幣","教育與醫療","航運"],"a":2,"e":"Provinces handle municipal government, education, health, natural resources, property and civil rights, and highways.","ze":"省負責市鎮政府、教育、醫療、自然資源、財產與民事權利、公路。","p":2,"id":"q0178","slug":"06-how-canadians-govern"},{"ch":"06","q":"Do the three northern territories have the status of provinces?","zq":"北方三個地區有省的地位嗎？","o":["Yes, since 1999","No, but their governments and assemblies carry out many of the same functions","Yes, since 1867","No, they are governed directly by the Senate"],"zo":["有，1999 年起","沒有，但它們的政府和議會執行許多相同職能","有，1867 年起","沒有，由參議院直接管理"],"a":1,"e":"The territories have small populations and do not have provincial status.","ze":"地區人口稀少，沒有省的地位。","p":3,"id":"q0179","slug":"06-how-canadians-govern"},{"ch":"06","q":"How often are members of the House of Commons traditionally elected?","zq":"眾議院議員傳統上多久選一次？","o":["Every two years","Every four years","Every five years","Every six years"],"zo":["每兩年","每四年","每五年","每六年"],"a":1,"e":"The House of Commons is the representative chamber elected by the people.","ze":"眾議院是人民選出的民意代表議事廳。","p":6,"id":"q0180","slug":"06-how-canadians-govern"},{"ch":"06","q":"As Head of the Commonwealth, the Sovereign links Canada to how many other nations?","zq":"作為大英國協元首，君主把加拿大與其他多少個國家連結起來？","o":["13","27","53","193"],"zo":["13","27","53","193"],"a":2,"e":"Commonwealth nations cooperate to advance social, economic and cultural progress.","ze":"國協國家合作推動社會、經濟和文化進步。","p":9,"id":"q0181","slug":"06-how-canadians-govern"},{"ch":"06","q":"Which of these countries is NOT listed in the guide as a constitutional monarchy?","zq":"下列哪個國家不在指南列出的君主立憲國中？","o":["Japan","Sweden","France","Thailand"],"zo":["日本","瑞典","法國","泰國"],"a":2,"e":"Listed: Denmark, Norway, Sweden, Australia, New Zealand, the Netherlands, Spain, Thailand, Japan, Jordan and Morocco.","ze":"列出的有丹麥、挪威、瑞典、澳洲、紐西蘭、荷蘭、西班牙、泰國、日本、約旦和摩洛哥。","p":9,"id":"q0182","slug":"06-how-canadians-govern"},{"ch":"06","q":"In Quebec, members of the provincial legislature are called what?","zq":"在魁北克，省議會的議員叫什麼？","o":["MPPs","MLAs","MNAs (members of the National Assembly)","MHAs"],"zo":["MPP","MLA","MNA（國民議會議員）","MHA"],"a":2,"e":"MPPs in Ontario, MLAs in most provinces, MHAs in Newfoundland and Labrador.","ze":"安大略是 MPP，多數省 MLA，紐芬蘭是 MHA。","p":13,"id":"q0183","slug":"06-how-canadians-govern"},{"ch":"06","q":"Which level of government usually includes a mayor (or reeve) and councillors?","zq":"哪一級政府通常包括市長（或鄉長）和議員？","o":["Federal","Provincial","Municipal","Territorial"],"zo":["聯邦","省","市鎮","地區"],"a":2,"e":"Municipal councils pass by-laws affecting only the local community.","ze":"市鎮議會通過只影響當地的地方法規。","p":16,"id":"q0184","slug":"06-how-canadians-govern"},{"ch":"06","q":"Who reviews bills besides the House of Commons before they become law?","zq":"除了眾議院，法案成為法律前還由誰審議？","o":["The Supreme Court","The Senate","The provinces","The Cabinet only"],"zo":["最高法院","參議院","各省","只有內閣"],"a":1,"e":"Both chambers must pass a bill, then it receives royal assent.","ze":"兩院都須通過法案，之後才獲御准。","p":6,"id":"q0185","slug":"06-how-canadians-govern"},{"ch":"07","q":"How many candidates can there be in an electoral district?","zq":"一個選區可以有幾位候選人？","o":["Only one","Only two","Many","Exactly four"],"zo":["只有一位","只有兩位","很多位","正好四位"],"a":2,"e":"The candidate who receives the most votes becomes the MP.","ze":"得票最多的候選人成為國會議員。","p":3,"id":"q0186","slug":"07-federal-elections"},{"ch":"07","q":"What is the National Register of Electors?","zq":"什麼是「全國選民登記冊」？","o":["A list of MPs","A permanent database of Canadian citizens 18 or older who are qualified to vote","A tax list","A census"],"zo":["國會議員名單","有資格投票的 18 歲以上加拿大公民的永久資料庫","稅務名單","人口普查"],"a":1,"e":"Elections Canada produces voters' lists from it.","ze":"加拿大選舉局據此製作選民名冊。","p":6,"id":"q0187","slug":"07-federal-elections"},{"ch":"07","q":"What does the voter information card list?","zq":"選民資訊卡上列出什麼？","o":["Your candidate's name","When and where you vote, and a number to call for an interpreter or special services","Your tax return","Your riding's history"],"zo":["你的候選人姓名","你投票的時間和地點，以及需要口譯或特殊服務時的電話","你的報稅表","你選區的歷史"],"a":1,"e":"The card is mailed once an election has been called.","ze":"選舉一經宣布就會寄出。","p":7,"id":"q0188","slug":"07-federal-elections"},{"ch":"07","q":"Immediately after the polling stations close, what happens?","zq":"投票站一關閉，會發生什麼？","o":["Ballots are stored for a month","Election officers count the ballots and results are announced on radio, television and in newspapers","The Senate reviews the vote","Voters go home and wait a week"],"zo":["選票保存一個月","選務人員開票，結果在廣播、電視和報紙公布","參議院審查投票","選民回家等一週"],"a":1,"e":"Results are made public the same night.","ze":"結果當晚公布。","p":9,"id":"q0189","slug":"07-federal-elections"},{"ch":"07","q":"Who runs the federal government departments?","zq":"誰負責管理聯邦政府各部門？","o":["Senators","Cabinet ministers","Provincial premiers","Judges"],"zo":["參議員","內閣部長","省長","法官"],"a":1,"e":"The Prime Minister chooses the ministers, mostly from the House of Commons.","ze":"總理挑選部長，多數來自眾議院。","p":12,"id":"q0190","slug":"07-federal-elections"},{"ch":"07","q":"Who prepares the budget and proposes most new laws?","zq":"誰編列預算並提出大多數新法律？","o":["The Senate","The Cabinet","The Governor General","Elections Canada"],"zo":["參議院","內閣","總督","加拿大選舉局"],"a":1,"e":"Cabinet decisions can be questioned by all members of the House of Commons.","ze":"內閣決定可受所有眾議院議員質詢。","p":12,"id":"q0191","slug":"07-federal-elections"},{"ch":"07","q":"What is the role of the opposition parties?","zq":"反對黨的角色是什麼？","o":["To run the government departments","To peacefully oppose or try to improve government proposals","To appoint judges","To count the ballots"],"zo":["管理政府部門","和平地反對或設法改善政府提案","任命法官","計算選票"],"a":1,"e":"The largest opposition party is the Official Opposition.","ze":"最大的反對黨是官方反對黨。","p":13,"id":"q0192","slug":"07-federal-elections"},{"ch":"07","q":"What should you bring to the polling station on election day?","zq":"選舉日去投票站要帶什麼？","o":["Your passport only","Your voter information card and proof of identity and address","A photo of your candidate","Nothing"],"zo":["只帶護照","選民資訊卡以及身分和地址證明","候選人的照片","什麼都不用"],"a":1,"e":"The polling station location is on your voter information card.","ze":"投票站地點在選民資訊卡上。","p":17,"id":"q0193","slug":"07-federal-elections"},{"ch":"07","q":"If you did not get a voter information card and do not have your local elections office number, whom can you call?","zq":"如果沒收到選民資訊卡也沒有當地選舉辦公室的電話，可以打給誰？","o":["The Prime Minister","Elections Canada in Ottawa at 1-800-463-6868","The RCMP","Your MP"],"zo":["總理","渥太華的加拿大選舉局 1-800-463-6868","皇家騎警","你的國會議員"],"a":1,"e":"You can be added to the voters' list at any time, even on election day.","ze":"你隨時可以被加入選民名冊，甚至在選舉日。","p":15,"id":"q0194","slug":"07-federal-elections"},{"ch":"07","q":"By law, when must federal elections be held?","zq":"依法，聯邦選舉必須在什麼時候舉行？","o":["The first Monday of September every five years","The third Monday in October every four years","July 1 every four years","Whenever the Senate decides"],"zo":["每五年 9 月第一個星期一","每四年 10 月第三個星期一","每四年 7 月 1 日","參議院決定時"],"a":1,"e":"The Prime Minister may also ask the Governor General to call an earlier election.","ze":"總理也可以請總督提前舉行選舉。","p":1,"id":"q0195","slug":"07-federal-elections"},{"ch":"07","q":"What is an electoral district also called?","zq":"選區還有什麼別稱？","o":["A county","A riding or constituency","A province","A ward"],"zo":["郡","riding 或 constituency","省","區"],"a":1,"e":"Each riding elects one MP to the House of Commons.","ze":"每個選區選出一位國會議員進入眾議院。","p":2,"id":"q0196","slug":"07-federal-elections"},{"ch":"07","q":"How old must a Canadian citizen be to run in a federal election?","zq":"加拿大公民幾歲才能參選聯邦選舉？","o":["16","18","21","25"],"zo":["16","18","21","25"],"a":1,"e":"Citizens 18 or older may run; those who run are called candidates.","ze":"18 歲以上可參選；參選者稱為候選人。","p":3,"id":"q0197","slug":"07-federal-elections"},{"ch":"07","q":"Which of the following is NOT a requirement to vote in a federal election?","zq":"下列哪一項不是聯邦選舉的投票資格？","o":["Being a Canadian citizen","Being at least 18 on voting day","Being on the voters' list","Owning property"],"zo":["加拿大公民","投票日年滿 18 歲","在選民名冊上","擁有財產"],"a":3,"e":"Property ownership stopped being a requirement long ago; the three requirements are citizenship, age 18, and the voters' list.","ze":"擁有財產早已不是條件；三項資格是公民、18 歲、在選民名冊上。","p":5,"id":"q0198","slug":"07-federal-elections"},{"ch":"07","q":"Which neutral agency of Parliament produces the voters' lists from the National Register of Electors?","zq":"哪個國會中立機構根據全國選民登記冊製作選民名冊？","o":["Statistics Canada","Elections Canada","The RCMP","Service Canada"],"zo":["加拿大統計局","加拿大選舉局","皇家騎警","加拿大服務局"],"a":1,"e":"Elections Canada mails a voter information card to each elector once an election is called.","ze":"選舉一經宣布，加拿大選舉局會寄選民資訊卡給每位選民。","p":6,"id":"q0199","slug":"07-federal-elections"},{"ch":"07","q":"True or false: If you do not receive a voter information card, you cannot vote.","zq":"是非題：如果沒收到選民資訊卡，你就不能投票。","o":["True","False"],"zo":["對","錯"],"a":1,"e":"You can be added to the voters' list at any time, including on election day.","ze":"你隨時可以被加入選民名冊，包括選舉日當天。","p":8,"id":"q0200","slug":"07-federal-elections"},{"ch":"07","q":"What does the secret ballot mean?","zq":"「不記名投票」是什麼意思？","o":["You must tell your employer how you voted","No one can watch you vote and no one should look at how you voted","Only the government knows your vote","Your vote is published"],"zo":["你必須告訴雇主投給誰","沒人可以看你投票，也沒人應該看你投給了誰","只有政府知道你的投票","你的投票會公布"],"a":1,"e":"No one, including family, employer or union, has the right to insist you tell them.","ze":"沒有人——包括家人、雇主、工會——有權堅持要你說。","p":9,"id":"q0201","slug":"07-federal-elections"},{"ch":"07","q":"After an election, who is invited by the Governor General to form the government?","zq":"選舉後，總督邀請誰組成政府？","o":["The leader of the party with the most seats in the House of Commons","The oldest MP","The leader of the Senate","The Chief Justice"],"zo":["眾議院席次最多政黨的領袖","最年長的國會議員","參議院領袖","首席大法官"],"a":0,"e":"That leader becomes the Prime Minister.","ze":"該領袖成為總理。","p":10,"id":"q0202","slug":"07-federal-elections"},{"ch":"07","q":"What is a majority government?","zq":"什麼是「多數政府」？","o":["When the party in power holds at least half of the seats in the House of Commons","When the party in power wins the Senate","When two parties share power","When the Governor General agrees"],"zo":["執政黨在眾議院擁有至少一半席次","執政黨贏得參議院","兩黨共享權力","總督同意時"],"a":0,"e":"With less than half the seats it is a minority government.","ze":"席次不到一半就是少數政府。","p":10,"id":"q0203","slug":"07-federal-elections"},{"ch":"07","q":"When the House of Commons votes on the budget, this is considered a matter of what?","zq":"眾議院對預算投票時，這被視為什麼？","o":["Routine","Confidence","Ceremony","Appeal"],"zo":["例行公事","信任投票","儀式","上訴"],"a":1,"e":"If a majority votes against a major government decision, the government is defeated and an election usually follows.","ze":"多數議員否決重大決定則政府被擊敗，通常接著舉行選舉。","p":11,"id":"q0204","slug":"07-federal-elections"},{"ch":"07","q":"The opposition party with the most members of the House of Commons is called what?","zq":"眾議院席次最多的反對黨叫什麼？","o":["The Shadow Government","The Official Opposition or Her Majesty's Loyal Opposition","The Minority Party","The Second Party"],"zo":["影子政府","官方反對黨（女王陛下的忠誠反對黨）","少數黨","第二黨"],"a":1,"e":"The role of opposition parties is to peacefully oppose or try to improve government proposals.","ze":"反對黨的角色是和平反對或設法改善政府提案。","p":13,"id":"q0205","slug":"07-federal-elections"},{"ch":"07","q":"Which three major political parties does the guide name as represented in the House of Commons?","zq":"指南列出眾議院有席次的三大政黨是哪三個？","o":["Conservative, New Democratic and Liberal","Liberal, Green and Bloc","Conservative, Republican and Democratic","Labour, Liberal and Reform"],"zo":["保守黨、新民主黨、自由黨","自由黨、綠黨、魁北克集團","保守黨、共和黨、民主黨","工黨、自由黨、改革黨"],"a":0,"e":"The Conservative Party, the New Democratic Party and the Liberal Party.","ze":"保守黨、新民主黨和自由黨。","p":13,"id":"q0206","slug":"07-federal-elections"},{"ch":"07","q":"How do you mark your ballot?","zq":"你怎麼畫選票？","o":["Sign your name next to the candidate","Mark an \"X\" in the circle next to the candidate of your choice","Write the party name","Tick every candidate you like"],"zo":["在候選人旁簽名","在你選擇的候選人旁的圓圈裡畫「X」","寫政黨名稱","勾選所有你喜歡的候選人"],"a":1,"e":"Then fold the ballot and present it to the poll officials.","ze":"然後摺起選票交給工作人員。","p":18,"id":"q0207","slug":"07-federal-elections"},{"ch":"07","q":"What does the poll official do with your ballot after you have marked it?","zq":"你畫好選票後，工作人員做什麼？","o":["Reads it and records your vote","Tears off the ballot number and gives it back to you to deposit in the ballot box","Mails it to Ottawa","Keeps it"],"zo":["讀取並記錄你的投票","撕下選票編號後交還給你投進投票箱","寄到渥太華","保留它"],"a":1,"e":"This keeps the vote secret while ensuring each ballot is counted.","ze":"這樣既保密又確保每張選票被計算。","p":20,"id":"q0208","slug":"07-federal-elections"},{"ch":"07","q":"If you cannot vote on election day, what can you do?","zq":"如果選舉日不能投票，你可以怎麼做？","o":["Nothing; you lose your vote","Vote at the advance polls or by special ballot","Ask a family member to vote for you","Vote online"],"zo":["沒辦法，你失去投票權","提前投票或用特別選票","請家人代投","線上投票"],"a":1,"e":"The dates and location of advance polls are on your voter information card.","ze":"提前投票的日期和地點在選民資訊卡上。","p":16,"id":"q0209","slug":"07-federal-elections"},{"ch":"08","q":"The Canadian justice system is founded on which principle in criminal matters?","zq":"加拿大司法系統在刑事案件上建立在什麼原則之上？","o":["Guilty until proven innocent","The presumption of innocence — everyone is innocent until proven guilty","Trial by combat","Majority vote"],"zo":["有罪推定","無罪推定——被證明有罪前人人無辜","決鬥審判","多數表決"],"a":1,"e":"Everyone is guaranteed due process under the law.","ze":"每個人依法享有正當程序。","p":0,"id":"q0210","slug":"08-justice-system"},{"ch":"08","q":"What is due process?","zq":"什麼是「正當程序」？","o":["The right to a quick trial","The principle that the government must respect all the legal rights a person is entitled to under the law","The process of becoming a citizen","A police procedure"],"zo":["快速審判的權利","政府必須尊重一個人依法享有的所有法律權利的原則","入籍的程序","警察程序"],"a":1,"e":"Canada's legal system rests on the rule of law, freedom under the law, democratic principles and due process.","ze":"加拿大法律制度建立在法治、法律之下的自由、民主原則和正當程序之上。","p":1,"id":"q0211","slug":"08-justice-system"},{"ch":"08","q":"What is Canada's highest court?","zq":"加拿大最高的法院是什麼？","o":["The Federal Court of Canada","The Supreme Court of Canada","The Court of Queen's Bench","The Court of Appeal"],"zo":["加拿大聯邦法院","加拿大最高法院","女王座法院","上訴法院"],"a":1,"e":"The Supreme Court of Canada has nine judges appointed by the Governor General.","ze":"加拿大最高法院有九位總督任命的法官。","p":4,"id":"q0212","slug":"08-justice-system"},{"ch":"08","q":"Which court deals with matters concerning the federal government?","zq":"哪個法院處理與聯邦政府有關的事務？","o":["The Federal Court of Canada","Small claims court","Family court","Traffic court"],"zo":["加拿大聯邦法院","小額索賠法院","家事法院","交通法院"],"a":0,"e":"Provinces also have appeal courts, trial courts, family, traffic and small claims courts.","ze":"各省還有上訴法院、審判法院、家事、交通和小額索賠法院。","p":4,"id":"q0213","slug":"08-justice-system"},{"ch":"08","q":"In Canada, the law applies to whom?","zq":"在加拿大，法律適用於誰？","o":["Only citizens","Everyone, including judges, politicians and the police","Only people over 18","Only residents of cities"],"zo":["只有公民","每一個人，包括法官、政治人物和警察","只有 18 歲以上的人","只有城市居民"],"a":1,"e":"No person or group is above the law.","ze":"沒有人或團體凌駕於法律之上。","p":2,"id":"q0214","slug":"08-justice-system"},{"ch":"08","q":"Which provinces have their own provincial police forces?","zq":"哪些省有自己的省警察？","o":["Alberta and British Columbia","Ontario and Quebec","Nova Scotia and New Brunswick","Manitoba and Saskatchewan"],"zo":["亞伯達與卑詩","安大略與魁北克","新斯科細亞與新布藍瑞克","曼尼托巴與薩克其萬"],"a":1,"e":"The RCMP serves as the provincial police everywhere except Ontario and Quebec.","ze":"皇家騎警在安大略和魁北克以外的省和地區擔任省警察。","p":6,"id":"q0215","slug":"08-justice-system"},{"ch":"08","q":"True or false: You can question the police about their service or conduct if you feel you need to.","zq":"是非題：如果你覺得有必要，可以質疑警察的服務或行為。","o":["True","False"],"zo":["對","錯"],"a":0,"e":"Almost all police forces have a process for bringing concerns and seeking action.","ze":"幾乎所有警察機關都有反映疑慮並要求處理的程序。","p":7,"id":"q0216","slug":"08-justice-system"},{"ch":"08","q":"If you cannot pay for a lawyer, what is available in most communities?","zq":"如果付不起律師費，大多數社區有什麼？","o":["Nothing","Legal aid services free of charge or at low cost","A government-appointed judge","A police lawyer"],"zo":["沒有","免費或低收費的法律援助服務","政府指派的法官","警察律師"],"a":1,"e":"Lawyers can help with legal problems and act for you in court.","ze":"律師可以幫你處理法律問題並在法庭代表你。","p":9,"id":"q0217","slug":"08-justice-system"},{"ch":"09","q":"When was the current Canadian flag raised for the first time?","zq":"現在的加拿大國旗在哪一年第一次升起？","o":["1867","1921","1965","1982"],"zo":["1867","1921","1965","1982"],"a":2,"e":"Red and white have been the national colours since 1921; the flag dates from 1965.","ze":"紅白自 1921 年起是國家代表色；國旗 1965 年誕生。","p":2,"id":"q0218","slug":"09-canadian-symbols"},{"ch":"09","q":"Which flag served as the Canadian flag for about 100 years before 1965?","zq":"1965 年以前約一百年間，哪面旗幟作為加拿大國旗？","o":["The Union Jack","The Canadian Red Ensign","The fleur-de-lys flag","The Maple Leaf Tartan"],"zo":["英國國旗","加拿大紅船旗","百合花旗","楓葉格紋旗"],"a":1,"e":"The Union Jack is the official Royal Flag; the Red Ensign was the Canadian flag for about 100 years.","ze":"英國國旗是正式的王室旗幟；紅船旗約一百年間作為加拿大國旗。","p":2,"id":"q0219","slug":"09-canadian-symbols"},{"ch":"09","q":"What is Canada's best-known symbol?","zq":"加拿大最著名的象徵是什麼？","o":["The beaver","The maple leaf","The fleur-de-lys","The Crown"],"zo":["海狸","楓葉","百合花飾","王權"],"a":1,"e":"Maple leaves have appeared on Canadian uniforms since the 1850s.","ze":"楓葉自 1850 年代起出現在加拿大軍服上。","p":3,"id":"q0220","slug":"09-canadian-symbols"},{"ch":"09","q":"What does Canada's national motto \"A mari usque ad mare\" mean?","zq":"加拿大國家格言「A mari usque ad mare」是什麼意思？","o":["Peace, order and good government","From sea to sea","Strong and free","Unity in diversity"],"zo":["和平、秩序與良好政府","從海到海","強大而自由","多元中的團結"],"a":1,"e":"The coat of arms and motto were adopted after the First World War.","ze":"國徽和格言在第一次世界大戰後採用。","p":5,"id":"q0221","slug":"09-canadian-symbols"},{"ch":"09","q":"The Peace Tower on Parliament Hill was completed in 1927 in memory of what?","zq":"國會山莊的和平塔 1927 年完工，是為了紀念什麼？","o":["Confederation","The First World War","The War of 1812","The Second World War"],"zo":["聯邦成立","第一次世界大戰","1812 年戰爭","第二次世界大戰"],"a":1,"e":"The Memorial Chamber contains the Books of Remembrance.","ze":"塔內的紀念廳存放《紀念名冊》。","p":6,"id":"q0222","slug":"09-canadian-symbols"},{"ch":"09","q":"What is Canada's national winter sport?","zq":"加拿大的國家冬季運動是什麼？","o":["Curling","Skiing","Hockey","Canadian football"],"zo":["冰壺","滑雪","曲棍球","加拿大式足球"],"a":2,"e":"Hockey is the most popular spectator sport; the NHL plays for the Stanley Cup, donated in 1892 by Lord Stanley.","ze":"曲棍球是最受歡迎的觀賞運動；NHL 爭奪 1892 年史丹利勳爵捐贈的史丹利盃。","p":8,"id":"q0223","slug":"09-canadian-symbols"},{"ch":"09","q":"What is Canada's official summer sport?","zq":"加拿大官方的夏季運動是什麼？","o":["Soccer","Baseball","Lacrosse","Basketball"],"zo":["足球","棒球","袋棍球","籃球"],"a":2,"e":"Lacrosse is an ancient sport first played by Aboriginals.","ze":"袋棍球是原住民最早玩的古老運動。","p":9,"id":"q0224","slug":"09-canadian-symbols"},{"ch":"09","q":"On which coin can the beaver be seen?","zq":"海狸出現在哪一種硬幣上？","o":["The one-cent coin","The five-cent coin","The ten-cent coin","The one-dollar coin"],"zo":["一分硬幣","五分硬幣","十分硬幣","一元硬幣"],"a":1,"e":"The beaver was a symbol of the Hudson's Bay Company and appears on the five-cent coin.","ze":"海狸曾是哈德遜灣公司的象徵，出現在五分硬幣上。","p":10,"id":"q0225","slug":"09-canadian-symbols"},{"ch":"09","q":"When was O Canada proclaimed the national anthem?","zq":"《噢！加拿大》在哪一年被宣布為國歌？","o":["1880","1921","1967","1980"],"zo":["1880","1921","1967","1980"],"a":3,"e":"It was first sung in Québec City in 1880 and proclaimed the anthem in 1980.","ze":"1880 年首次在魁北克市演唱，1980 年宣布為國歌。","p":13,"id":"q0226","slug":"09-canadian-symbols"},{"ch":"09","q":"What is the Royal Anthem of Canada?","zq":"加拿大的皇家國歌是什麼？","o":["O Canada","God Save the Queen (or King)","The Maple Leaf Forever","Land of Hope and Glory"],"zo":["《噢！加拿大》","《天佑女王（或國王）》","《楓葉永恆》","《希望與榮耀之地》"],"a":1,"e":"It can be played or sung on any occasion when Canadians wish to honour the Sovereign.","ze":"在加拿大人想向君主致敬的任何場合都可以演奏或演唱。","p":15,"id":"q0227","slug":"09-canadian-symbols"},{"ch":"09","q":"In what year did Canada start its own honours system with the Order of Canada?","zq":"加拿大在哪一年以「加拿大勳章」開始自己的榮譽制度？","o":["1867","1921","1967","1982"],"zo":["1867","1921","1967","1982"],"a":2,"e":"1967, the centennial of Confederation.","ze":"1967 年，聯邦成立一百週年。","p":16,"id":"q0228","slug":"09-canadian-symbols"},{"ch":"09","q":"What is the highest honour available to Canadians?","zq":"加拿大人能獲得的最高榮譽是什麼？","o":["The Order of Canada","The Victoria Cross","The Stanley Cup","The Governor General's Award"],"zo":["加拿大勳章","維多利亞十字勳章","史丹利盃","總督獎"],"a":1,"e":"The V.C. has been awarded to 96 Canadians since 1854.","ze":"自 1854 年起已有 96 位加拿大人獲頒。","p":17,"id":"q0229","slug":"09-canadian-symbols"},{"ch":"09","q":"When is Victoria Day?","zq":"維多利亞日是什麼時候？","o":["The Monday preceding May 25","July 1","The first Monday of September","November 11"],"zo":["5 月 25 日之前的星期一","7 月 1 日","9 月第一個星期一","11 月 11 日"],"a":0,"e":"Victoria Day marks the Sovereign's birthday.","ze":"維多利亞日是君主誕辰。","p":18,"id":"q0230","slug":"09-canadian-symbols"},{"ch":"09","q":"When is Thanksgiving Day in Canada?","zq":"加拿大的感恩節是什麼時候？","o":["The fourth Thursday of November","The second Monday of October","The first Monday of September","December 26"],"zo":["11 月第四個星期四","10 月第二個星期一","9 月第一個星期一","12 月 26 日"],"a":1,"e":"Labour Day is the first Monday of September; Boxing Day is December 26.","ze":"勞動節是 9 月第一個星期一；節禮日是 12 月 26 日。","p":18,"id":"q0231","slug":"09-canadian-symbols"},{"ch":"09","q":"What are the three main objectives of the Official Languages Act of 1969?","zq":"1969 年《官方語言法》的三大目標是什麼？","o":["Make everyone bilingual, close English schools, promote French abroad","Establish equality of French and English in federal institutions, maintain official language minority communities, and promote equality of French and English in society","Make French the only official language, fund Quebec, end immigration","Teach French in all provinces, ban other languages, promote English"],"zo":["讓人人雙語、關閉英語學校、對外推廣法語","在聯邦機構建立英法平等、維持官方語言少數社群、在社會中促進英法平等","讓法語成為唯一官方語言、資助魁北克、停止移民","在各省教法語、禁止其他語言、推廣英語"],"a":1,"e":"English and French are important symbols of identity.","ze":"英語和法語是重要的身分象徵。","p":12,"id":"q0232","slug":"09-canadian-symbols"},{"ch":"08","q":"Who makes the laws in Canada?","zq":"在加拿大，法律由誰制定？","o":["Judges","The police","Elected representatives","The Governor General alone"],"zo":["法官","警察","民選代表","總督一人"],"a":2,"e":"Laws are made by elected representatives; courts settle disputes; police enforce the laws.","ze":"法律由民選代表制定；法院解決糾紛；警察執行法律。","p":2,"id":"q0233","slug":"08-justice-system"},{"ch":"08","q":"What are Canada's laws intended to provide, according to the guide?","zq":"根據指南，加拿大的法律旨在提供什麼？","o":["Profit for lawyers","Order in society and a peaceful way to settle disputes","Advantages for the government","Rules only for immigrants"],"zo":["律師的利潤","社會秩序與和平解決糾紛的方式","政府的優勢","只針對移民的規則"],"a":1,"e":"Laws also express the values and beliefs of Canadians.","ze":"法律也表達加拿大人的價值觀與信念。","p":2,"id":"q0234","slug":"08-justice-system"},{"ch":"08","q":"The blindfolded Lady Justice symbolizes what?","zq":"蒙眼的正義女神象徵什麼？","o":["Justice is slow","The impartial manner in which laws are administered: blind to all considerations but the facts","Judges cannot see","The law is secret"],"zo":["正義很慢","法律執行的公正：除了事實之外對一切考量視而不見","法官看不見","法律是秘密的"],"a":1,"e":"The statue stands at the Vancouver Law Courts.","ze":"這座雕像在溫哥華法院。","p":3,"id":"q0235","slug":"08-justice-system"},{"ch":"08","q":"Which court is sometimes called the Court of Queen's Bench or the Supreme Court in a province?","zq":"省裡哪種法院有時稱為「女王座法院」或「最高法院」？","o":["The appeal court","The trial court","Small claims court","Traffic court"],"zo":["上訴法院","審判法院","小額索賠法院","交通法院"],"a":1,"e":"Most provinces have an appeal court and a trial court.","ze":"大多數省有上訴法院和審判法院。","p":4,"id":"q0236","slug":"08-justice-system"},{"ch":"08","q":"Which court handles civil cases involving small sums of money?","zq":"哪種法院處理涉及小額金錢的民事案件？","o":["Family court","Traffic court","Small claims court","The Federal Court"],"zo":["家事法院","交通法院","小額索賠法院","聯邦法院"],"a":2,"e":"Provincial courts also handle lesser offences.","ze":"省法院也審理較輕罪行。","p":4,"id":"q0237","slug":"08-justice-system"},{"ch":"08","q":"In which situation can you ask the police for help, according to the guide?","zq":"根據指南，什麼情況下可以向警察求助？","o":["Only if you are a citizen","If there's been an accident, a theft, an assault, a crime in progress, or someone has gone missing","Only during business hours","Only through a lawyer"],"zo":["只有公民可以","發生意外、竊盜、攻擊、正在發生的犯罪或有人失蹤時","只在上班時間","只能透過律師"],"a":1,"e":"The police are there to keep people safe and to enforce the law.","ze":"警察的職責是保護人民安全並執行法律。","p":5,"id":"q0238","slug":"08-justice-system"},{"ch":"08","q":"Which police force enforces federal laws throughout Canada?","zq":"哪支警察在全加拿大執行聯邦法律？","o":["The Ontario Provincial Police","The Royal Canadian Mounted Police (RCMP)","The Toronto Police","The Coast Guard"],"zo":["安大略省警","皇家加拿大騎警（RCMP）","多倫多警察","海岸防衛隊"],"a":1,"e":"The RCMP also serves as provincial police outside Ontario and Quebec.","ze":"皇家騎警也在安大略、魁北克以外擔任省警察。","p":6,"id":"q0239","slug":"08-justice-system"},{"ch":"08","q":"Do all provinces have municipal police departments?","zq":"所有省都有市警察局嗎？","o":["No, only Ontario","Yes, there are municipal police departments in all provinces","No, only the territories","Only cities over one million"],"zo":["沒有，只有安大略","有，所有省都有市警察局","沒有，只有地區","只有人口超過一百萬的城市"],"a":1,"e":"There are different types of police in Canada.","ze":"加拿大有不同種類的警察。","p":6,"id":"q0240","slug":"08-justice-system"},{"ch":"08","q":"What does the guide remind you about the police?","zq":"指南提醒你關於警察的什麼？","o":["Avoid them","The police are there to help you","Never call them","They only speak French"],"zo":["避開他們","警察是來幫助你的","永遠別打給他們","他們只說法語"],"a":1,"e":"\"Remember, the police are there to help you.\"","ze":"「記住，警察是來幫助你的。」","p":6,"id":"q0241","slug":"08-justice-system"},{"ch":"08","q":"What role do prisons have, according to the guide?","zq":"根據指南，監獄有什麼角色？","o":["Educating immigrants","Punishing criminals and deterring crime","Housing the homeless","Training police"],"zo":["教育移民","懲罰罪犯和嚇阻犯罪","收容遊民","訓練警察"],"a":1,"e":"Prisons have an essential role in punishing criminals and deterring crime.","ze":"監獄在懲罰罪犯和嚇阻犯罪方面扮演重要角色。","p":8,"id":"q0242","slug":"08-justice-system"},{"ch":"08","q":"Who can act for you in court?","zq":"誰可以在法庭上代表你？","o":["A police officer","A lawyer","A senator","Your MP"],"zo":["警察","律師","參議員","你的國會議員"],"a":1,"e":"Lawyers help with legal problems and act for you in court.","ze":"律師幫你處理法律問題並在法庭代表你。","p":9,"id":"q0243","slug":"08-justice-system"},{"ch":"08","q":"True or false: Judges and politicians are above the law in Canada.","zq":"是非題：在加拿大，法官和政治人物凌駕於法律之上。","o":["True","False"],"zo":["對","錯"],"a":1,"e":"The law applies to everyone, including judges, politicians and the police.","ze":"法律適用於每一個人，包括法官、政治人物和警察。","p":2,"id":"q0244","slug":"08-justice-system"},{"ch":"09","q":"For how many years has the Crown been a symbol of the state in Canada?","zq":"王權作為加拿大國家的象徵有多少年？","o":["100 years","200 years","400 years","1,000 years"],"zo":["100 年","200 年","400 年","1,000 年"],"a":2,"e":"Canada has been a constitutional monarchy in its own right since Confederation in 1867.","ze":"自 1867 年聯邦成立起加拿大本身就是君主立憲國。","p":1,"id":"q0245","slug":"09-canadian-symbols"},{"ch":"09","q":"Where does the red-white-red pattern of the Canadian flag come from?","zq":"加拿大國旗紅－白－紅的圖案來自哪裡？","o":["The French flag","The flag of the Royal Military College, Kingston","The Union Jack","The Quebec flag"],"zo":["法國國旗","京士頓皇家軍事學院的旗幟","英國國旗","魁北克省旗"],"a":1,"e":"The Royal Military College was founded in 1876.","ze":"皇家軍事學院創立於 1876 年。","p":2,"id":"q0246","slug":"09-canadian-symbols"},{"ch":"09","q":"In what year did Quebec adopt its own flag, based on the Cross and the fleur-de-lys?","zq":"魁北克在哪一年採用以十字和百合花飾為基礎的省旗？","o":["1867","1921","1948","1965"],"zo":["1867","1921","1948","1965"],"a":2,"e":"The fleur-de-lys was the symbol of French royalty for more than 1,000 years.","ze":"百合花飾是法國王室象徵超過一千年。","p":4,"id":"q0247","slug":"09-canadian-symbols"},{"ch":"09","q":"Which part of the original Parliament Buildings survived the 1916 fire?","zq":"原始國會大廈哪一部分在 1916 年火災中倖存？","o":["The Centre Block","The Peace Tower","The Library","The Senate chamber"],"zo":["中央大樓","和平塔","圖書館","參議院議事廳"],"a":2,"e":"The Centre Block was rebuilt in 1922; the Peace Tower completed in 1927.","ze":"中央大樓 1922 年重建；和平塔 1927 年完工。","p":6,"id":"q0248","slug":"09-canadian-symbols"},{"ch":"09","q":"Who donated the Stanley Cup in 1892?","zq":"1892 年誰捐贈了史丹利盃？","o":["Lord Grey","Lord Stanley, the Governor General","Adrienne Clarkson","Sir John A. Macdonald"],"zo":["格雷勳爵","總督史丹利勳爵","伍冰枝","約翰・A・麥克唐納爵士"],"a":1,"e":"The Clarkson Cup (2005) is awarded for women's hockey.","ze":"克拉克森盃（2005）頒給女子曲棍球。","p":8,"id":"q0249","slug":"09-canadian-symbols"},{"ch":"09","q":"Which sport has the most registered players of any game in Canada?","zq":"哪種運動在加拿大的註冊球員最多？","o":["Hockey","Soccer","Curling","Lacrosse"],"zo":["曲棍球","足球","冰壺","袋棍球"],"a":1,"e":"Canadian football is the second most popular sport; curling was introduced by Scottish pioneers.","ze":"加拿大式足球是第二受歡迎；冰壺由蘇格蘭人引進。","p":9,"id":"q0250","slug":"09-canadian-symbols"},{"ch":"09","q":"Adult applicants of what age are exempted from the language requirement?","zq":"幾歲以上的成年申請人免除語言要求？","o":["50 or over","55 or over","60 or over","65 or over"],"zo":["50 歲以上","55 歲以上","60 歲以上","65 歲以上"],"a":1,"e":"You must otherwise have adequate knowledge of English or French.","ze":"否則必須具備足夠的英語或法語能力。","p":11,"id":"q0251","slug":"09-canadian-symbols"},{"ch":"09","q":"Where was O Canada first sung, and in what year?","zq":"《噢！加拿大》最早在哪裡、哪一年演唱？","o":["Ottawa, 1867","Québec City, 1880","Toronto, 1921","Montreal, 1967"],"zo":["渥太華，1867","魁北克市，1880","多倫多，1921","蒙特婁，1967"],"a":1,"e":"French and English Canadians sing different words to the anthem.","ze":"法裔和英裔加拿大人唱的歌詞不同。","p":13,"id":"q0252","slug":"09-canadian-symbols"},{"ch":"09","q":"Who was the first Canadian to be awarded the Victoria Cross?","zq":"第一位獲頒維多利亞十字勳章的加拿大人是誰？","o":["Billy Bishop","Alexander Roberts Dunn","William Hall","Filip Konowal"],"zo":["比利・畢曉普","亞歷山大・羅伯茨・鄧恩","威廉・霍爾","菲利普・科諾瓦爾"],"a":1,"e":"Dunn served in the Charge of the Light Brigade at Balaclava in 1854.","ze":"鄧恩參加了 1854 年巴拉克拉瓦的輕騎兵衝鋒。","p":17,"id":"q0253","slug":"09-canadian-symbols"},{"ch":"09","q":"Who was the first black man to be awarded the Victoria Cross?","zq":"第一位獲頒維多利亞十字勳章的黑人是誰？","o":["William Hall of Nova Scotia","Paul Triquet","Robert Hampton Gray","Joseph Brant"],"zo":["新斯科細亞的威廉・霍爾","保羅・特里凱","羅伯特・漢普頓・格雷","約瑟夫・布蘭特"],"a":0,"e":"Able Seaman William Hall earned it in the Siege of Lucknow in 1857.","ze":"一等水兵威廉・霍爾在 1857 年勒克瑙圍城戰中獲頒。","p":17,"id":"q0254","slug":"09-canadian-symbols"},{"ch":"09","q":"When is Canada Day?","zq":"加拿大日是什麼時候？","o":["June 24","July 1","July 4","September 30"],"zo":["6 月 24 日","7 月 1 日","7 月 4 日","9 月 30 日"],"a":1,"e":"July 1 commemorates Confederation in 1867.","ze":"7 月 1 日紀念 1867 年聯邦成立。","p":18,"id":"q0255","slug":"09-canadian-symbols"},{"ch":"09","q":"When is Sir Wilfrid Laurier Day?","zq":"威爾弗里德・勞里埃爵士日是哪一天？","o":["January 11","April 9","November 20","December 26"],"zo":["1 月 11 日","4 月 9 日","11 月 20 日","12 月 26 日"],"a":2,"e":"January 11 is Sir John A. Macdonald Day; April 9 is Vimy Day; December 26 is Boxing Day.","ze":"1 月 11 日是麥克唐納日；4 月 9 日維米日；12 月 26 日節禮日。","p":18,"id":"q0256","slug":"09-canadian-symbols"},{"ch":"10","q":"Why is trade important to Canada, according to the guide?","zq":"根據指南，貿易為什麼對加拿大重要？","o":["Canada cannot grow food","Canadians could not maintain their standard of living without trading with other nations","It is required by the Constitution","Only for tourism"],"zo":["加拿大種不出糧食","不與其他國家貿易就無法維持生活水準","憲法規定","只為了旅遊"],"a":1,"e":"Commerce remains the engine of economic growth.","ze":"商業仍是經濟成長的引擎。","p":0,"id":"q0257","slug":"10-canadas-economy"},{"ch":"10","q":"Which country became a partner in NAFTA in 1994?","zq":"哪個國家在 1994 年加入北美自由貿易協定？","o":["The United Kingdom","Mexico","Japan","Germany"],"zo":["英國","墨西哥","日本","德國"],"a":1,"e":"NAFTA covered over 444 million people and over $1 trillion in merchandise trade in 2008.","ze":"NAFTA 涵蓋超過 4.44 億人口，2008 年商品貿易超過一兆美元。","p":1,"id":"q0258","slug":"10-canadas-economy"},{"ch":"10","q":"Which of the following is a service industry job?","zq":"下列哪一項是服務業工作？","o":["Mining","Forestry","Health care","Manufacturing cars"],"zo":["礦業","林業","醫療","製造汽車"],"a":2,"e":"Service industries include transportation, education, health care, construction, banking, communications, retail, tourism and government.","ze":"服務業包括運輸、教育、醫療、建築、銀行、通訊、零售、旅遊和政府。","p":3,"id":"q0259","slug":"10-canadas-economy"},{"ch":"10","q":"Which of the following is a manufactured product listed in the guide?","zq":"下列哪一項是指南列出的製造品？","o":["Uranium","Lumber","Aerospace technology","Fish"],"zo":["鈾","木材","航太技術","魚"],"a":2,"e":"Manufactured products include paper, high technology equipment, aerospace technology, automobiles, machinery, food and clothing.","ze":"製造品包括紙張、高科技設備、航太技術、汽車、機械、食品和衣物。","p":4,"id":"q0260","slug":"10-canadas-economy"},{"ch":"10","q":"Which of these belongs to the natural resources industries?","zq":"下列哪一項屬於自然資源產業？","o":["Banking","Retail","Forestry","Tourism"],"zo":["銀行","零售","林業","旅遊"],"a":2,"e":"Natural resources industries include forestry, fishing, agriculture, mining and energy.","ze":"自然資源產業包括林業、漁業、農業、礦業和能源。","p":5,"id":"q0261","slug":"10-canadas-economy"},{"ch":"10","q":"A large percentage of Canada's exports are what?","zq":"加拿大出口有很大一部分是什麼？","o":["Software","Natural resources commodities","Clothing","Movies"],"zo":["軟體","自然資源商品","衣物","電影"],"a":1,"e":"Many areas of the country still depend on developing natural resources.","ze":"國內許多地區仍依賴開發自然資源。","p":5,"id":"q0262","slug":"10-canadas-economy"},{"ch":"10","q":"What fraction of Canadian exports are destined for the U.S.A.?","zq":"加拿大出口有多少比例銷往美國？","o":["About one-quarter","About half","Over three-quarters","All"],"zo":["約四分之一","約一半","超過四分之三","全部"],"a":2,"e":"Canada and the U.S.A. have the biggest bilateral trading relationship in the world.","ze":"加美擁有世界最大的雙邊貿易關係。","p":6,"id":"q0263","slug":"10-canadas-economy"},{"ch":"10","q":"The Canada-U.S.A. border is traditionally known as what?","zq":"加美邊界傳統上被稱為什麼？","o":["The Iron Curtain","The world's longest undefended border","The Great Wall","The Peace Line"],"zo":["鐵幕","世界最長的不設防邊界","長城","和平線"],"a":1,"e":"Millions of Canadians and Americans cross it safely every year.","ze":"每年數百萬加拿大人和美國人安全穿越。","p":6,"id":"q0264","slug":"10-canadas-economy"},{"ch":"10","q":"Where is the Peace Arch located?","zq":"和平拱門位於哪裡？","o":["Niagara Falls, Ontario","Blaine, Washington","Windsor, Ontario","Halifax, Nova Scotia"],"zo":["安大略尼加拉瀑布","華盛頓州布萊恩","安大略溫莎","新斯科細亞哈利法克斯"],"a":1,"e":"It symbolizes the close ties and common interests of the two countries.","ze":"它象徵兩國緊密的關係與共同利益。","p":7,"id":"q0265","slug":"10-canadas-economy"},{"ch":"10","q":"Canada has one of the how many largest economies in the world, according to the guide?","zq":"根據指南，加拿大是世界前幾大經濟體之一？","o":["Three","Five","Ten","Fifty"],"zo":["三","五","十","五十"],"a":2,"e":"Canada has one of the ten largest economies in the world.","ze":"加拿大是世界十大經濟體之一。","p":2,"id":"q0266","slug":"10-canadas-economy"},{"ch":"10","q":"Which countries, besides Canada, does the guide list in the G8?","zq":"除了加拿大，指南列出 G8 還有哪些國家？","o":["China, India, Brazil, Mexico, Korea, Spain, Australia","The United States, Germany, the United Kingdom, Italy, France, Japan and Russia","Only the United States and the United Kingdom","Mexico, Cuba, Chile, Peru, Argentina, Colombia, Venezuela"],"zo":["中國、印度、巴西、墨西哥、韓國、西班牙、澳洲","美國、德國、英國、義大利、法國、日本和俄羅斯","只有美國和英國","墨西哥、古巴、智利、秘魯、阿根廷、哥倫比亞、委內瑞拉"],"a":1,"e":"Since 2014 the group has been the G7 without Russia.","ze":"2014 年起沒有俄羅斯，稱為 G7。","p":2,"id":"q0267","slug":"10-canadas-economy"},{"ch":"10","q":"What agreement replaced NAFTA in 2020?","zq":"2020 年什麼協定取代了 NAFTA？","o":["GATT","CUSMA (the Canada-United States-Mexico Agreement)","NATO","WTO"],"zo":["關稅暨貿易總協定","加美墨協定（CUSMA）","北約","世界貿易組織"],"a":1,"e":"The 2021 guide still says NAFTA; the current agreement is CUSMA.","ze":"2021 年版指南仍寫 NAFTA；現行協定是 CUSMA。","p":1,"id":"q0268","slug":"10-canadas-economy"},{"ch":"10","q":"Integrated Canada-U.S.A. supply chains compete with whom?","zq":"加美一體化的供應鏈與誰競爭？","o":["Each other","The rest of the world","Mexico only","Europe only"],"zo":["彼此","世界其他地區","只有墨西哥","只有歐洲"],"a":1,"e":"Canada exports billions of dollars of energy, industrial, automotive, agricultural and consumer goods every year.","ze":"加拿大每年出口數十億美元的能源、工業、汽車、農產品和消費品。","p":6,"id":"q0269","slug":"10-canadas-economy"},{"ch":"10","q":"True or false: Most working Canadians have jobs in manufacturing.","zq":"是非題：大多數加拿大就業人口從事製造業。","o":["True","False"],"zo":["對","錯"],"a":1,"e":"More than 75% work in service industries.","ze":"超過 75% 從事服務業。","p":3,"id":"q0270","slug":"10-canadas-economy"},{"ch":"10","q":"Which is Canada's largest international trading partner?","zq":"加拿大最大的國際貿易夥伴是誰？","o":["China","The United Kingdom","The United States","Mexico"],"zo":["中國","英國","美國","墨西哥"],"a":2,"e":"Over three-quarters of Canadian exports go to the U.S.A.","ze":"加拿大四分之三以上的出口銷往美國。","p":6,"id":"q0271","slug":"10-canadas-economy"},{"ch":"10","q":"What are the three main types of industries in Canada's economy?","zq":"加拿大經濟的三大產業類型是什麼？","o":["Farming, fishing and mining","Service, manufacturing and natural resources industries","Banking, tourism and government","Oil, gas and forestry"],"zo":["農業、漁業、礦業","服務業、製造業、自然資源產業","銀行、旅遊、政府","石油、天然氣、林業"],"a":1,"e":"More than 75% of working Canadians have jobs in service industries.","ze":"超過 75% 的加拿大就業人口從事服務業。","p":3,"id":"q0272","slug":"10-canadas-economy"},{"ch":"10","q":"What percentage of working Canadians have jobs in service industries?","zq":"百分之多少的加拿大就業人口從事服務業？","o":["25%","50%","More than 75%","100%"],"zo":["25%","50%","超過 75%","100%"],"a":2,"e":"Service industries include transportation, education, health care, banking, retail and tourism.","ze":"服務業包括運輸、教育、醫療、銀行、零售和旅遊。","p":3,"id":"q0273","slug":"10-canadas-economy"},{"ch":"10","q":"In what year did Canada enact free trade with the United States?","zq":"加拿大在哪一年與美國實施自由貿易？","o":["1867","1988","1994","2020"],"zo":["1867","1988","1994","2020"],"a":1,"e":"Mexico joined in 1994 in NAFTA, replaced in 2020 by CUSMA.","ze":"墨西哥 1994 年加入 NAFTA，2020 年被 CUSMA 取代。","p":1,"id":"q0274","slug":"10-canadas-economy"},{"ch":"10","q":"Canada is part of which group of leading industrialized countries?","zq":"加拿大是哪個主要工業化國家集團的成員？","o":["The G8 (now G7)","OPEC","ASEAN","The European Union"],"zo":["G8（現為 G7）","石油輸出國組織","東協","歐盟"],"a":0,"e":"The guide says G8 with the U.S., Germany, the U.K., Italy, France, Japan and Russia; Russia was suspended in 2014.","ze":"指南寫 G8（美、德、英、義、法、日、俄）；俄羅斯 2014 年被停權。","p":2,"id":"q0275","slug":"10-canadas-economy"},{"ch":"10","q":"The Peace Arch at Blaine, Washington, is inscribed with which words?","zq":"華盛頓州布萊恩的和平拱門上刻著什麼字句？","o":["\"From sea to sea\"","\"Children of a common mother\" and \"brethren dwelling together in unity\"","\"Peace, order and good government\"","\"The true North strong and free\""],"zo":["「從海到海」","「同一位母親的子女」與「兄弟和睦同居」","「和平、秩序與良好政府」","「真正的北方，強大而自由」"],"a":1,"e":"The Arch symbolizes the close ties and common interests of Canada and the U.S.A.","ze":"拱門象徵加美的緊密關係與共同利益。","p":7,"id":"q0276","slug":"10-canadas-economy"},{"ch":"11","q":"What are the five regions of Canada?","zq":"加拿大的五大區域是什麼？","o":["North, South, East, West, Centre","The Atlantic Provinces, Central Canada, the Prairie Provinces, the West Coast and the Northern Territories","Ontario, Quebec, BC, Alberta and the North","Maritimes, Great Lakes, Rockies, Arctic, Pacific"],"zo":["北、南、東、西、中","大西洋省份、中部加拿大、草原省份、西海岸、北方地區","安大略、魁北克、卑詩、亞伯達、北方","濱海、五大湖、洛磯、北極、太平洋"],"a":1,"e":"Canada has ten provinces and three territories in five regions.","ze":"加拿大有十省三地區，分五個區域。","p":1,"id":"q0277","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"Who chose Ottawa as the capital in 1857?","zq":"1857 年誰選定渥太華為首都？","o":["Sir John A. Macdonald","Queen Victoria","King George III","Lord Durham"],"zo":["約翰・A・麥克唐納爵士","維多利亞女王","喬治三世","德倫勳爵"],"a":1,"e":"Ottawa, on the Ottawa River, is Canada's fourth largest metropolitan area.","ze":"渥太華河畔的渥太華是加拿大第四大都會區。","p":2,"id":"q0278","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"What is the capital of Ontario?","zq":"安大略的首府是哪裡？","o":["Ottawa","Toronto","Kingston","Hamilton"],"zo":["渥太華","多倫多","京士頓","漢米爾頓"],"a":1,"e":"Toronto is the capital of Ontario and Canada's largest city; Ottawa is the national capital.","ze":"多倫多是安大略首府、加拿大最大城市；渥太華是國家首都。","p":4,"id":"q0279","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"Which provinces are the Atlantic Provinces?","zq":"哪些省是大西洋省份？","o":["Quebec, Ontario, Manitoba, Saskatchewan","Newfoundland and Labrador, Prince Edward Island, Nova Scotia, New Brunswick","Nova Scotia, Quebec, Maine, PEI","New Brunswick, Nunavut, Yukon, Labrador"],"zo":["魁北克、安大略、曼尼托巴、薩克其萬","紐芬蘭與拉布拉多、愛德華王子島、新斯科細亞、新布藍瑞克","新斯科細亞、魁北克、緬因、愛德華王子島","新布藍瑞克、努納福特、育空、拉布拉多"],"a":1,"e":"Their coasts and natural resources made them an important part of Canada's history.","ze":"它們的海岸與自然資源是加拿大歷史的重要部分。","p":4,"id":"q0280","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"Which province is the smallest and the birthplace of Confederation?","zq":"哪個省最小、也是聯邦的誕生地？","o":["Nova Scotia","Prince Edward Island","New Brunswick","Newfoundland and Labrador"],"zo":["新斯科細亞","愛德華王子島","新布藍瑞克","紐芬蘭與拉布拉多"],"a":1,"e":"P.E.I. is connected to the mainland by the Confederation Bridge and is the setting of Anne of Green Gables.","ze":"愛德華王子島由聯邦大橋與本土相連，也是《清秀佳人》的故事背景。","p":8,"id":"q0281","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"Which province has the world's highest tides in the Bay of Fundy?","zq":"哪個省的芬迪灣有世界最高的潮汐？","o":["Nova Scotia","Quebec","British Columbia","Manitoba"],"zo":["新斯科細亞","魁北克","卑詩","曼尼托巴"],"a":0,"e":"Halifax, its capital, is Canada's largest east coast port and home to the largest naval base.","ze":"首府哈利法克斯是加拿大東岸最大港口，也有最大海軍基地。","p":9,"id":"q0282","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"What is the capital of New Brunswick?","zq":"新布藍瑞克的首府是哪裡？","o":["Saint John","Moncton","Fredericton","Halifax"],"zo":["聖約翰","蒙克頓","弗雷德里克頓","哈利法克斯"],"a":2,"e":"Saint John is the largest city; Moncton the Acadian centre; Fredericton the historic capital.","ze":"聖約翰是最大城市；蒙克頓是阿卡迪亞中心；弗雷德里克頓是歷史首府。","p":10,"id":"q0283","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"Which is the second largest mainly French-speaking city in the world after Paris?","zq":"哪個城市是世界上僅次於巴黎的第二大法語城市？","o":["Québec City","Montreal","Moncton","Ottawa"],"zo":["魁北克市","蒙特婁","蒙克頓","渥太華"],"a":1,"e":"Montreal is Canada's second largest city and famous for its cultural diversity.","ze":"蒙特婁是加拿大第二大城市，以文化多元聞名。","p":12,"id":"q0284","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"Which is the largest freshwater lake in the world?","zq":"世界最大的淡水湖是哪一個？","o":["Lake Ontario","Lake Erie","Lake Huron","Lake Superior"],"zo":["安大略湖","伊利湖","休倫湖","蘇必略湖"],"a":3,"e":"The five Great Lakes lie between Ontario and the United States.","ze":"五大湖位於安大略與美國之間。","p":13,"id":"q0285","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"Where is the training academy of the Royal Canadian Mounted Police?","zq":"皇家加拿大騎警的訓練學院在哪裡？","o":["Ottawa","Regina, Saskatchewan","Winnipeg","Edmonton"],"zo":["渥太華","薩克其萬里賈納","溫尼伯","艾德蒙頓"],"a":1,"e":"Regina is the capital of Saskatchewan, the \"breadbasket of the world.\"","ze":"里賈納是薩克其萬首府，「世界的麵包籃」。","p":16,"id":"q0286","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"Which province is the largest producer of oil and gas in Canada?","zq":"哪個省是加拿大最大的石油和天然氣生產地？","o":["Saskatchewan","Alberta","Newfoundland and Labrador","British Columbia"],"zo":["薩克其萬","亞伯達","紐芬蘭與拉布拉多","卑詩"],"a":1,"e":"Alberta also has five national parks including Banff, established in 1885.","ze":"亞伯達也有五個國家公園，包括 1885 年設立的班夫。","p":17,"id":"q0287","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"What is the capital of British Columbia?","zq":"卑詩省的首府是哪裡？","o":["Vancouver","Victoria","Kelowna","Whitehorse"],"zo":["溫哥華","維多利亞","基隆拿","白馬市"],"a":1,"e":"Victoria is headquarters of the navy's Pacific fleet; Vancouver has Canada's largest port.","ze":"維多利亞是海軍太平洋艦隊總部；溫哥華有加拿大最大港口。","p":19,"id":"q0288","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"What is the capital of Nunavut?","zq":"努納福特的首府是哪裡？","o":["Yellowknife","Whitehorse","Iqaluit","Churchill"],"zo":["黃刀鎮","白馬市","伊魁特","邱吉爾"],"a":2,"e":"Nunavut, meaning \"our land\" in Inuktitut, was established in 1999.","ze":"努納福特在因紐特語中意為「我們的土地」，1999 年設立。","p":23,"id":"q0289","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"Which territory holds the record for the coldest temperature ever recorded in Canada?","zq":"哪個地區保有加拿大有記錄以來最低溫的紀錄？","o":["Northwest Territories","Nunavut","Yukon","Labrador"],"zo":["西北地區","努納福特","育空","拉布拉多"],"a":2,"e":"Yukon recorded -63°C; Mount Logan in the Yukon is Canada's highest mountain.","ze":"育空曾記錄零下 63 度；育空的洛根山是加拿大最高峰。","p":22,"id":"q0290","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"Why is the North called the \"Land of the Midnight Sun\"?","zq":"北方為什麼被稱為「午夜太陽之地」？","o":["Because the sun never rises","Because at the height of summer, daylight can last up to 24 hours","Because of the northern lights","Because it is always warm"],"zo":["因為太陽從不升起","因為盛夏白晝可長達 24 小時","因為極光","因為一直很溫暖"],"a":1,"e":"In winter, darkness sets in for three months.","ze":"冬天黑暗持續三個月。","p":20,"id":"q0291","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"Which capital city is called the \"diamond capital of North America\"?","zq":"哪個首府被稱為「北美鑽石之都」？","o":["Whitehorse","Iqaluit","Yellowknife","Regina"],"zo":["白馬市","伊魁特","黃刀鎮","里賈納"],"a":2,"e":"Yellowknife is the capital of the Northwest Territories.","ze":"黃刀鎮是西北地區的首府。","p":21,"id":"q0292","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"12","q":"How many questions are on the citizenship test, and how many must you answer correctly to pass?","zq":"公民考試有幾題？答對幾題才通過？","o":["10 questions, 7 correct","20 questions, 15 correct","30 questions, 20 correct","50 questions, 40 correct"],"zo":["10 題，答對 7 題","20 題，答對 15 題","30 題，答對 20 題","50 題，答對 40 題"],"a":1,"e":"20 multiple-choice or true-false questions in 30 minutes; 15 correct to pass.","ze":"20 題選擇或是非題，30 分鐘，答對 15 題通過。","p":0,"id":"q0293","slug":"12-study-questions"},{"ch":"12","q":"ONTARIO: What is the capital of Ontario?","zq":"安大略省題：安大略的首府是哪裡？","o":["Ottawa","Toronto","London","Mississauga"],"zo":["渥太華","多倫多","倫敦","密西沙加"],"a":1,"e":"Toronto. The national capital, Ottawa, is also in Ontario.","ze":"多倫多。國家首都渥太華也在安大略。","p":30,"id":"q0294","slug":"12-study-questions"},{"ch":"12","q":"ONTARIO: Who represents the Sovereign in Ontario?","zq":"安大略省題：誰在安大略代表君主？","o":["The Premier","The Lieutenant Governor of Ontario","The Governor General","The Mayor of Toronto"],"zo":["省長","安大略省督","總督","多倫多市長"],"a":1,"e":"As of 2026 the Lieutenant Governor is Edith Dumont; confirm on ontario.ca before your test.","ze":"2026 年現任省督是 Edith Dumont；考前到 ontario.ca 確認。","p":30,"id":"q0295","slug":"12-study-questions"},{"ch":"12","q":"ONTARIO: What is the head of the Ontario government called?","zq":"安大略省題：安大略政府的首長叫什麼？","o":["The Prime Minister","The Premier","The Governor","The Commissioner"],"zo":["總理","省長（Premier）","州長","專員"],"a":1,"e":"As of 2026 the Premier is Doug Ford (Progressive Conservative); confirm before your test.","ze":"2026 年現任省長是 Doug Ford（進步保守黨）；考前確認。","p":30,"id":"q0296","slug":"12-study-questions"},{"ch":"12","q":"ONTARIO: Members of the Ontario legislature are called what?","zq":"安大略省題：安大略議會的議員叫什麼？","o":["MLAs","MPPs","MNAs","MHAs"],"zo":["MLA","MPP","MNA","MHA"],"a":1,"e":"Members of the Provincial Parliament. Look up your own MPP and your federal MP by postal code before the test.","ze":"省議會議員（MPP）。考前用郵遞區號查自己的 MPP 和聯邦 MP。","p":30,"id":"q0297","slug":"12-study-questions"},{"ch":"11","q":"Canada is the second largest country on earth, with how many square kilometres?","zq":"加拿大是地球第二大國家，面積多少平方公里？","o":["1 million","5 million","10 million","20 million"],"zo":["一百萬","五百萬","一千萬","兩千萬"],"a":2,"e":"Three oceans line its frontiers: Pacific, Atlantic and Arctic.","ze":"三個大洋環繞：太平洋、大西洋、北冰洋。","p":0,"id":"q0298","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"About how many people live in Canada, according to the 2021 guide?","zq":"根據 2021 年版指南，加拿大約有多少人口？","o":["24 million","34 million","44 million","54 million"],"zo":["2,400 萬","3,400 萬","4,400 萬","5,400 萬"],"a":1,"e":"The guide says about 34 million; Canada passed 40 million in 2023.","ze":"指南寫約 3,400 萬；加拿大 2023 年已突破 4,000 萬。","p":5,"id":"q0299","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"Which province has its own time zone and is the most easterly point in North America?","zq":"哪個省有自己的時區，也是北美最東端？","o":["Nova Scotia","Newfoundland and Labrador","Prince Edward Island","New Brunswick"],"zo":["新斯科細亞","紐芬蘭與拉布拉多","愛德華王子島","新布藍瑞克"],"a":1,"e":"It was the oldest colony of the British Empire.","ze":"它曾是大英帝國最古老的殖民地。","p":7,"id":"q0300","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"Which province is Canada's main producer of pulp and paper and its largest producer of hydro-electricity?","zq":"哪個省是加拿大主要的紙漿和紙張生產地，也是最大的水力發電生產者？","o":["Ontario","Quebec","British Columbia","Manitoba"],"zo":["安大略","魁北克","卑詩","曼尼托巴"],"a":1,"e":"Nearly eight million people live in Quebec, mostly along the St. Lawrence River.","ze":"將近八百萬人住在魁北克，多沿聖羅倫斯河。","p":12,"id":"q0301","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"Which province has the largest French-speaking population outside Quebec?","zq":"哪個省擁有魁北克以外最多的法語人口？","o":["Manitoba","New Brunswick","Ontario","Nova Scotia"],"zo":["曼尼托巴","新布藍瑞克","安大略","新斯科細亞"],"a":2,"e":"Ontario's people make up more than one-third of Canadians.","ze":"安大略人口占加拿大三分之一以上。","p":13,"id":"q0302","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"What is the most famous street intersection in Canada, according to the guide?","zq":"根據指南，加拿大最著名的十字路口是哪裡？","o":["Yonge and Bloor","Portage and Main in Winnipeg","Robson and Granville","Sparks and Elgin"],"zo":["央街與布洛爾","溫尼伯的波蒂奇大道與緬街","羅布森街與格蘭維爾街","斯帕克斯街與埃爾金街"],"a":1,"e":"Winnipeg's French Quarter, St. Boniface, has Western Canada's largest Francophone community.","ze":"溫尼伯的法語區聖博尼法斯有加拿大西部最大的法語社群。","p":15,"id":"q0303","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"Which province has the largest Aboriginal population of any province, at over 15%?","zq":"哪個省的原住民人口比例在各省中最高，超過 15%？","o":["Saskatchewan","Manitoba","Alberta","British Columbia"],"zo":["薩克其萬","曼尼托巴","亞伯達","卑詩"],"a":1,"e":"Manitoba is also an important centre of Ukrainian culture.","ze":"曼尼托巴也是烏克蘭文化的重要中心。","p":15,"id":"q0304","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"Which two resources does Saskatchewan have the world's richest deposits of?","zq":"薩克其萬擁有世界上最豐富的哪兩種礦藏？","o":["Gold and silver","Uranium and potash","Oil and coal","Diamonds and zinc"],"zo":["金和銀","鈾和鉀鹽","石油和煤","鑽石和鋅"],"a":1,"e":"Saskatchewan has 40% of the arable land in Canada.","ze":"薩克其萬擁有加拿大 40% 的可耕地。","p":16,"id":"q0305","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"Alberta and Lake Louise were both named after whom?","zq":"亞伯達省和露易絲湖都以誰命名？","o":["Queen Victoria","Princess Louise Caroline Alberta, fourth daughter of Queen Victoria","Queen Elizabeth II","Louise Imbeault"],"zo":["維多利亞女王","維多利亞女王的第四個女兒露易絲・卡洛琳・亞伯達公主","伊莉莎白二世女王","露易絲・因博"],"a":1,"e":"Alberta has five national parks, including Banff, established in 1885.","ze":"亞伯達有五個國家公園，包括 1885 年設立的班夫。","p":17,"id":"q0306","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"About half of all the goods produced in British Columbia are what?","zq":"卑詩省生產的商品約有一半是什麼？","o":["Automobiles","Forestry products","Fish","Wine"],"zo":["汽車","林產品","魚","葡萄酒"],"a":1,"e":"B.C. has the most valuable forestry industry in Canada and about 600 provincial parks.","ze":"卑詩省有加拿大最有價值的林業和約 600 個省立公園。","p":19,"id":"q0307","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"What fraction of Canada's land mass do the three territories contain?","zq":"三個地區占加拿大陸地面積的多少？","o":["One-tenth","One-quarter","One-third","One-half"],"zo":["十分之一","四分之一","三分之一","一半"],"a":2,"e":"But they have a population of only 100,000.","ze":"但人口只有十萬。","p":20,"id":"q0308","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"What is the Mackenzie River?","zq":"馬更些河是什麼？","o":["Canada's shortest river","The second-longest river system in North America after the Mississippi","A river in Quebec","A canal"],"zo":["加拿大最短的河","北美僅次於密西西比河的第二長河流系統","魁北克的一條河","一條運河"],"a":1,"e":"At 4,200 km it drains 1.8 million square kilometres.","ze":"長 4,200 公里，流域 180 萬平方公里。","p":21,"id":"q0309","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"Whose poetry celebrated the Yukon Gold Rush of the 1890s?","zq":"誰的詩歌歌頌了 1890 年代的育空淘金熱？","o":["John McCrae","Robert W. Service","Stephen Leacock","Pauline Johnson"],"zo":["約翰・麥克雷","羅伯特・W・瑟維斯","史蒂芬・里柯克","寶琳・強森"],"a":1,"e":"The White Pass and Yukon Railway opened in 1900.","ze":"白隘口與育空鐵路 1900 年通車。","p":22,"id":"q0310","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"What percentage of Nunavut's population is Inuit?","zq":"努納福特人口有百分之多少是因紐特人？","o":["25%","50%","85%","100%"],"zo":["25%","50%","85%","100%"],"a":2,"e":"Inuktitut is an official language and the first language in schools.","ze":"因紐特語是官方語言，也是學校的第一語言。","p":23,"id":"q0311","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"Who are the Canadian Rangers?","zq":"加拿大巡邏隊是誰？","o":["Park wardens","Part of the Canadian Forces Reserves who patrol the North and keep the flag flying in the Arctic","Hockey players","Border guards"],"zo":["公園管理員","加拿大軍隊後備部隊的一部分，巡邏北方、讓國旗在北極飄揚","曲棍球員","邊境守衛"],"a":1,"e":"They travel by snowmobile in winter and all-terrain vehicles in summer.","ze":"他們冬天騎雪上摩托車、夏天駕全地形車。","p":24,"id":"q0312","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"11","q":"Which region is known as the industrial and manufacturing heartland of Canada?","zq":"哪個區域被稱為加拿大的工業和製造業心臟地帶？","o":["The Atlantic Provinces","Central Canada (southern Quebec and Ontario)","The Prairie Provinces","The North"],"zo":["大西洋省份","中部加拿大（魁北克南部與安大略）","草原省份","北方"],"a":1,"e":"Ontario and Quebec produce more than three-quarters of all Canadian manufactured goods.","ze":"安大略和魁北克生產四分之三以上的加拿大製造品。","p":11,"id":"q0313","slug":"11-canadas-regions"},{"ch":"12","q":"How long do you have to write the citizenship test?","zq":"公民考試的作答時間有多長？","o":["15 minutes","30 minutes","60 minutes","Two hours"],"zo":["15 分鐘","30 分鐘","60 分鐘","兩小時"],"a":1,"e":"20 questions in 30 minutes; 15 correct to pass.","ze":"30 分鐘 20 題，答對 15 題通過。","p":0,"id":"q0314","slug":"12-study-questions"},{"ch":"12","q":"In which languages can you take the citizenship test?","zq":"公民考試可以用哪些語言？","o":["English or French","English only","Any language","Chinese or English"],"zo":["英文或法文","只有英文","任何語言","中文或英文"],"a":0,"e":"The test is in one of Canada's two official languages.","ze":"考試用加拿大兩種官方語言之一。","p":0,"id":"q0315","slug":"12-study-questions"},{"ch":"12","q":"ONTARIO: Where is the Ontario legislature located?","zq":"安大略省題：安大略省議會在哪裡？","o":["Ottawa","Queen's Park, Toronto","Kingston","Hamilton"],"zo":["渥太華","多倫多皇后公園","京士頓","漢米爾頓"],"a":1,"e":"Ontario's Legislative Assembly sits at Queen's Park in Toronto.","ze":"安大略立法議會位於多倫多皇后公園。","p":30,"id":"q0316","slug":"12-study-questions"},{"ch":"12","q":"ONTARIO: Which of the following is a provincial responsibility that Ontario handles?","zq":"安大略省題：下列哪一項是安大略負責的省級職責？","o":["National defence","Education and health care","Foreign policy","Currency"],"zo":["國防","教育與醫療","外交政策","貨幣"],"a":1,"e":"Ontario also has its own provincial police force, the OPP.","ze":"安大略也有自己的省警察 OPP。","p":30,"id":"q0317","slug":"12-study-questions"},{"ch":"12","q":"ONTARIO: What is the name of the Ontario provincial police force?","zq":"安大略省題：安大略省警察的名稱是什麼？","o":["The RCMP","The Ontario Provincial Police (OPP)","The Sûreté","The Mounties"],"zo":["皇家騎警","安大略省警（OPP）","魁北克省警","騎警"],"a":1,"e":"Only Ontario and Quebec have provincial police forces.","ze":"只有安大略和魁北克有省警察。","p":30,"id":"q0318","slug":"12-study-questions"},{"ch":"12","q":"ONTARIO: Which is the largest city in Ontario and in Canada?","zq":"安大略省題：安大略和加拿大最大的城市是哪裡？","o":["Ottawa","Toronto","Mississauga","Montreal"],"zo":["渥太華","多倫多","密西沙加","蒙特婁"],"a":1,"e":"Toronto is also Canada's main financial centre.","ze":"多倫多也是加拿大主要的金融中心。","p":30,"id":"q0319","slug":"12-study-questions"},{"ch":"12","q":"ONTARIO: The Niagara region of Ontario is known for what?","zq":"安大略省題：安大略的尼加拉地區以什麼聞名？","o":["Oil sands","Vineyards, wines and fruit crops","Diamond mines","Potash"],"zo":["油砂","葡萄園、葡萄酒和水果","鑽石礦","鉀鹽"],"a":1,"e":"Ontario farmers also raise dairy and beef cattle, poultry, vegetables and grain.","ze":"安大略農民也養乳牛、肉牛、家禽，種蔬菜和穀物。","p":30,"id":"q0320","slug":"12-study-questions"},{"ch":"12","q":"ONTARIO: Which Great Lake does NOT border Ontario?","zq":"安大略省題：哪個大湖不與安大略接壤？","o":["Lake Ontario","Lake Erie","Lake Michigan","Lake Huron"],"zo":["安大略湖","伊利湖","密西根湖","休倫湖"],"a":2,"e":"Lake Michigan is in the U.S.A.; Lake Superior is the largest freshwater lake in the world.","ze":"密西根湖在美國；蘇必略湖是世界最大淡水湖。","p":30,"id":"q0321","slug":"12-study-questions"},{"ch":"12","q":"ONTARIO: Who founded Ontario, according to the guide?","zq":"安大略省題：根據指南，安大略由誰建立？","o":["The Acadians","The United Empire Loyalists","The Vikings","The Métis"],"zo":["阿卡迪亞人","聯合帝國效忠派","維京人","梅蒂人"],"a":1,"e":"Ontario was Upper Canada, mainly Loyalist, Protestant and English-speaking.","ze":"安大略前身是上加拿大，以效忠派、新教徒和英語人口為主。","p":30,"id":"q0322","slug":"12-study-questions"},{"ch":"12","q":"ONTARIO: What is the national capital, located in Ontario?","zq":"安大略省題：位於安大略的國家首都是哪裡？","o":["Toronto","Ottawa","Kingston","Québec City"],"zo":["多倫多","渥太華","京士頓","魁北克市"],"a":1,"e":"Ottawa, on the Ottawa River, was chosen by Queen Victoria in 1857.","ze":"渥太華河畔的渥太華由維多利亞女王在 1857 年選定。","p":30,"id":"q0323","slug":"12-study-questions"},{"ch":"12","q":"ONTARIO: Which party does Premier Doug Ford lead (as of 2026)?","zq":"安大略省題：省長 Doug Ford 領導哪個政黨（2026 年）？","o":["Liberal","Progressive Conservative","New Democratic","Green"],"zo":["自由黨","進步保守黨","新民主黨","綠黨"],"a":1,"e":"Confirm the current Premier and party on ontario.ca before your test.","ze":"考前到 ontario.ca 確認現任省長與政黨。","p":30,"id":"q0324","slug":"12-study-questions"},{"ch":"12","q":"ONTARIO: What is the name of your provincial electoral district and representative?","zq":"安大略省題：你的省選區和省議員叫什麼？","o":["Everyone has the same riding","It depends on where you live; look it up at elections.on.ca by postal code","Ontario has no ridings","Only Toronto has ridings"],"zo":["大家的選區都一樣","要看你住哪裡；到 elections.on.ca 用郵遞區號查","安大略沒有選區","只有多倫多有選區"],"a":1,"e":"Write down your MPP (provincial) and MP (federal) before the test.","ze":"考前寫下你的省議員 MPP 和聯邦議員 MP。","p":30,"id":"q0325","slug":"12-study-questions"},{"ch":"12","q":"ONTARIO: Approximately what share of Canadians live in Ontario?","zq":"安大略省題：大約多少比例的加拿大人住在安大略？","o":["One-tenth","One-quarter","More than one-third","One-half"],"zo":["十分之一","四分之一","三分之一以上","一半"],"a":2,"e":"At more than 12 million (2021 guide), Ontario has the largest population of any province.","ze":"2021 年版寫超過 1,200 萬，是人口最多的省。","p":30,"id":"q0326","slug":"12-study-questions"},{"ch":"12","q":"What is the passing score on the citizenship test?","zq":"公民考試的及格分數是多少？","o":["10 out of 20","12 out of 20","15 out of 20","20 out of 20"],"zo":["20 題對 10 題","20 題對 12 題","20 題對 15 題","20 題全對"],"a":2,"e":"15 correct answers out of 20, that is 75%.","ze":"20 題答對 15 題，即 75%。","p":0,"id":"q0327","slug":"12-study-questions"},{"ch":"12","q":"What types of questions are on the citizenship test?","zq":"公民考試有哪些題型？","o":["Essays","Multiple-choice and true-false questions","Oral speeches","Map drawing"],"zo":["作文","選擇題和是非題","口頭演講","畫地圖"],"a":1,"e":"All questions are based on the study guide.","ze":"所有題目都根據學習指南出題。","p":0,"id":"q0328","slug":"12-study-questions"}];